                     /product="putative transferase CaiE"
                     /label=caiE
                     /note="The function of the CaiE protein is currently
                     unknown.  Overproduction of CaiE appears to stimulate 
                     carnitine racemase activity of CaiD and carnitine 
                     dehydratase activity of CaiB, leading to the hypothesis 
                     that CaiE may be involved in the synthesis or activation of
                     an unknown cofactor required for these activities |CITS: 
                     [7815937]|.
                     "
