     CDS             complement(51229..51606)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="apaG"
                     /locus_tag="b0050"
                     /product="DUF525 domain-containing protein ApaG"
                     /label=apaG
                     /note="An <i>apaG</i> frameshift mutation affects
                     production of ApaH (diadenosine tetraphosphatase), 
                     indicating translational coregulation |CITS: [3031429]|. 
                     Mutations have been generated |CITS: [2157025]|. 
                     <i>apaG</i> belongs to a network of genes which facilitate 
                     stress-induced mutagenesis (SIM) in <i>E. coli</i> K-12 
                     |CITS: [23224554]|.
                     Regulation has been described |CITS: [3031429], [2670894]|.
                     "
