     gene            complement(70984..71967)
                     /gene="thiB"
                     /locus_tag="b0068"
                     /label=thiB
     CDS             complement(70984..71967)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="thiB"
                     /locus_tag="b0068"
                     /product="bifunctional thiamine ABC transporter
                     periplasmic binding protein / thiamine ABC transporter"
                     /EC_number="7.6.2.15"
                     /label=thiB
                     /note="<i>thiB</i> encodes the periplasmic, substrate
                     binding protein of an ATP-dependent thiamin uptake system. 
                     Purified ThiB binds thiamine and its phosphate esters - 
                     thiamine phosphate and thiamine diphosphate |CITS: 
                     [12182833][18177053]|. Purified ThiB binds thiamine with a 
                     1:1 stoichiometry and with high affinity; K<sub>D</sub> = 
                     0.8 &micro;M |CITS: [12182833]|. The crystal structure of 
                     ThiB consists of two domains linked by a flexible hinge 
                     region of two crossovers; thiamine phosphate binds in a 
                     cleft located between the two domains |CITS: [18177053]|. 
                     Purified ThiB binds thiamine, thiamine phosphate and 
                     thiamine diphosphate with high affinity (K<sub>D</sub> = 
                     3.8 nM, 2.3 nM and 7.4 nM respectively) |CITS: [18177053]|.
                     A thiamin pyrophosphate (TPP)-sensing riboswitch is located
                     upstream of <i>thiB</i>; TPP sensing by the riboswitch 
                     represses gene expression at the translational level and 
                     possibly at the transcriptional level; the riboswitch 
                     down-regulates translation by a mechanism that sequesters 
                     the ribosome binding site |CITS: 
                     [28520932][34740970][37419663][39420148][39218381]|."
