                     /note="Phospho-N-acetylmuramoyl-pentapeptide transferase 
                     catalyzes the first step of the lipid cycle reactions in 
                     the biosynthetic pathway of cell wall peptidoglycans |CITS:
                     [1846850]|.
                     MraY is of interest as an antibacterial drug target and has
                     been used to assess high-throughput screening performance 
                     using the BioAssay Ontology |CITS: [25415593]|."
