                     /note="Construction of a strain in which <i>yacH</i> is
                     replaced by an FRT-<i>lacZ-aph-</i>FRT cassette has been 
                     described |CITS: [12142427]|. <i>yacH</i> may encode a 
                     membrane protein; <i>yacH</i> transcription is reduced upon
                     exposure to a sublethal dose of the cationic antimicrobial 
                     insect peptide, cecropin A |CITS:[12499161]|."
