                     /product="multifunctional vitamin B12 ABC transporter
                     periplasmic binding protein / vitamin B12 ABC transporter /
                     vitamin B12 ABC transporter / cobinamide ABC transporter"
                     /EC_number="7.6.2.8"
                     /label=btuF
                     /note="BtuF is the periplasmic binding protein of an 
                     ATP-dependent vitamin B<sub>12</sub> uptake system. 
                     Purified BtuF binds cyanocobalamin with high affinity 
                     (K<sub>d</sub> approx 15 nM) |CITS: [11790740]|; purified 
                     BtuF binds cobinamide with high affinity (K<sub>d</sub> = 
                     40 nM) |CITS: [28128319]|
                     Purified BtuF contains two structurally similar lobes 
                     connected by a single linking &alpha;-helix; Vitamin 
                     B<sub>12</sub> binds in a deep cleft between the two lobes 
                     |CITS: [12475936]|"
