                     /product="uncharacterized protein YaeQ"
                     /label=yaeQ
                     /note="Purified YaeQ protein does not have transcription 
                     antitermination activity |CITS: [15503145]|, although 
                     expression of the <i>Salmonella typhimurium yaeQ</i> 
                     homolog suppresses the <i>E. coli rfaH</i> mutant defect in
                     expression of the <i>hlyCABD</i> operon |CITS: [9604894]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>yaeQ</i> mutant has aggravating genetic 
                     interactions with genes involved in DNA recombination 
                     |CITS: [26774489]|."
