                     /EC_number="3.5.1.111"
                     /label=yafV
                     /note="YafV is an &omega;-amidase that may function as a 
                     metabolite repair enzyme.  &alpha;-ketoglutaramate 
                     (&alpha;-KGM) is the product of a potential side reaction 
                     of glutamine aminotransferases.  The purified recombinant 
                     YafV expressed from an ASKA clone showed high activity 
                     toward &alpha;-KGM |CITS: [28373563]|."
