     CDS             249196..249648
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yafP"
                     /locus_tag="b0234"
                     /product="putative N-acetyltransferase YafP"
                     /label=yafP
                     /note="YafP is not a part of the YafO-YafN toxin-antitoxin 
                     system |CITS: [19837801]|.
                     Polar <i>dinB</i> mutations affecting the 
                     <i>dinB-yafN-yafO-yafP</i> operon reduce spontaneous 
                     mutagenesis
                     |CITS: [12813093]|; however, only DinB is required for 
                     stress-induced mutagenesis |CITS: [19837801]|.
                     The function of YafP in the uropathogenic strain <i>E. 
                     coli</i> CFT073 has been studied - results suggest YafP may
                     have a role in the metabolic transformation of carcinogenic
                     compounds |CITS: [21300638]|."
