                     /label=insI1
                     /note="This is the transposase for the insertion sequence
                     IS30.
                     The IS30 transposase interacts with the terminal inverted 
                     repeats of the IS30 sequence element, using them
                     as targets for transposition |CITS: [2154486][9393723]|. 
                     The carboxy-terminus of the transposase is required for 
                     formation and dissolution of the dimeric
                     transpositional intermediate |CITS: [9303555]|."
