     CDS             281106..282488
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yagG"
                     /locus_tag="b0270"
                     /product="CP4-6 prophage; putative D-xylonate transporter
                     YagG"
                     /label=yagG
                     /note="<i>yagGH</i> is predicted to be a member of the
                     |FRAME: EG20253-MONOMER ""XylR""| regulon; its products may
                     mediate transport (YagG) and hydrolysis (YagH) of 
                     xylooligosaccharides; putative XylR and CRP binding sites 
                     are identified upstream of <i>yagGH</i> |CITS: [11750821]|.
                     <i>yagG</i> may be part of a single <i>yagEFGH</i> operon 
                     which is under control of |FRAME: G6144-MONOMER ""XynR""| -
                     the regulator of xylonate catabolism; YagG is a putative 
                     |FRAME: D-XYLONATE| uptake transporter |CITS: [29087459]|. 
                     YagG is a member of the GPH family of 
                     glycoside-pentoside-hexuronide transporters |CITS: 
                     [8830272][26546518]|."
