                     vivo</i>, yields an incomplete polypeptidyl-tRNA species 
                     that is cleaved by Pth |CITS: [29100053]|. 
                     Ribosome-profiling data show a drop in ribosome occupancy 
                     at the ribosome-destabilizing sequence |CITS: [22456704]|."
