                     pathogenic <i>E. coli</i> strains at low temperatures but 
                     is not expressed in <i>E. coli</i> K-12 |CITS: 
                     [11466275][20522494][22355107]|.
                     Overexpression of the cloned <i>E. coli</i> K-12 MG1655 
                     <i>ecpABCDE</i> genes in wild type <i>E. coli</i> K-12 
                     MG1655 results in ECP expression at 20&deg;C and 37&deg;C 
                     and biofilm formation at 20&deg;C indicating that the genes
                     are functional in <i>E. coli</i> MG1655 but are not 
                     expressed |CITS: [20522494]|.
