                     /note="YkgA is similar to the transcription activators
                     MarA, SoxS, and Rob.  Overexpression of YkgA does not 
                     induce the expression of the tested <i>mar</i>, <i>sox</i> 
                     and <i>rob</i> regulon promoters, but does cause a slow 
                     growth phenotype |CITS: [10972816]|. YkgA may be the 
                     product of a pseudogene |CITS: [12234664]|."
