                     /product="protein YahV"
                     /label=yahV
                     /note="YahV was identified as a previously unannotated
                     small protein; its expression is higher during exponential 
                     phase than during stationary phase |CITS: [29645342]|. 
                     Based on co-occurrence literature analysis among <i>E. 
                     coli</i> K-12 strains in addition to genomic 
                     co-localization and sequence analysis, <i>yahV</i> is 
                     hypothesized to be a membrane-bound small protein that may 
                     help stabilize membranes during osmotic shock |CITS: 
                     [36855185]|."
