     gene            complement(329212..330144)
                     /gene="yahB"
                     /locus_tag="b0316"
                     /label=yahB
     CDS             complement(329212..330144)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yahB"
                     /locus_tag="b0316"
                     /product="putative LysR-type DNA-binding transcriptional
                     regulator YahB"
                     /label=yahB
                     /note="YahB was predicted to be a LysR-type transcription
                     factor |CITS: [34428301] [35880217]|, and it contains a 
                     helix-turn-helix motif to bind DNA in its N-terminal domain
                     |CITS: [35880217]|.
                     YahB DNA-binding activity was probed in vivo in glucose M9 
                     minimal medium through chromatin immunoprecipitation assays
                     (ChIP-exo) |CITS: [34428301]|. It was predicted to regulate
                     genes related to metabolism |CITS: [35880217]|. However, 
                     the effect of YahB on the transcription of any gene has not
                     yet been demonstrated |CITS: [34428301]|.
                     The transcription of the <i>yahB</i> gene is affected by 
                     temperature and Fe<sup>2+</sup> |CITS: [35880217]|.
                     "
