                     /note="Expression of <i>yahO</i> is dependent on 
                     &sigma;<sup>S</sup> |CITS: [15489429]|.
                     The mRNA of <i>yahO</i> appears to interact with the small 
                     regulatory RNA GlnZ, but it is not known how it regulates 
                     such mRNA |CITS: [36062564]|.
