                     /label=yaiY
     CDS             complement(394481..394789)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yaiY"
                     /locus_tag="b0379"
                     /product="DUF2755 domain-containing inner membrane protein
                     YaiY"
                     /label=yaiY
                     /note="YaiY localizes to the inner membrane.  YaiY is
                     predicted to contain two transmembrane domains; the C 
                     terminus is located in the cytoplasm |CITS: [15919996]|.
                     A meta-analysis of <i>E. coli</i> K-12 MG1655 
                     transcriptomic data sets in response to multiple stressors 
                     found 15 uncharacterized or partially characterized genes 
                     (<i>yqfA, yhfG, yhhA, ybgS, arpA, yqaE, yfdY, yaiY, yebE, 
                     ydiE, yjcB, yiiX, ycjF, yihF, yidX</i>) that were 
                     upregulated under all five stressors: heat, cold, oxidative
                     stress, nitrosative stress, and antibiotic treatment, 
                     whereas 3 uncharacterized or partially characterized genes 
                     (<i>ymfI, ydiJ, yedE</i>) that were downregulated under all
                     but nitrosative stress |CITS: [36144394]|."
