                     RTLRVAAGFDVADNEIVRQCEAGDLVITADIPLAAEAIEKGAAALNPRGERYTPATIRE
                     RLTMRDFMDTLRASGIQTGGPDSLSQRDRQAFAAELEKWWLEVQRSRG"
                     /go_component="cytosol [goid 0005829] [evidence IEA] [PMID
