                     /product="heme O synthase"
                     /EC_number="2.5.1.141"
                     /label=cyoE
                     /note="The CyoE protein, heme O synthase, catalyzes the 
                     synthesis of heme O, which is essential for the
                     catalytic functions of the cytochrome <i>bo</i> oxidase 
                     complex |CITS: [1336371][8253713]|.
                     At one time it was thought that CyoE was a fifth subunit of
                     the cytochrome <i>bo</i> oxidase, but it was shown that a
                     28 kDa polypeptide which co-purifies with the cytochrome 
                     <i>bo</i> oxidase complex appears even in a <i>cyoE</i> 
                     deletion strain |CITS: [8262927]|.
                     "
