                     /locus_tag="b0495"
                     /product="bifunctional putative ABC transporter
                     ATP-binding protein YbbA / putative transport complex, ABC 
                     superfamily"
                     /label=ybbA
                     /note="YbbA is the predicted ATP-binding subunit of a
                     putative ATP-binding cassette (ABC) exporter complex |CITS:
                     [26546518] [18634750]|. YbbA contains sequence motifs 
                     conserved in ATP-binding cassette proteins |CITS: 
                     [9593292]|. YbbA is upregulated in response to exogenous 
                     L-threonine; expression of <i>ybbA</i> from a multicopy 
                     plasmid increases the resistance of wild-type <i>E. 
                     coli</i> to high concentrations of L-threonine |CITS: 
                     [28911185]|."
