     gene            complement(657835..658098)
                     /gene="ybeD"
                     /locus_tag="b0631"
                     /label=ybeD
     CDS             complement(657835..658098)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ybeD"
                     /locus_tag="b0631"
                     /product="DUF493 domain-containing protein YbeD"
                     /label=ybeD
                     /note="YbeD is involved in the response to
                     high-temperature stress.  A &Delta;<i>ybeD</i> strain grows
                     more slowly and to a lower cell density than wild type, 
                     while overexpression of <i>ybeD</i> enhances growth at 
                     46&deg;C and alleviates the growth phenotypes of several 
                     chaperone mutants |CITS: [30939630]|.
                     A solution structure of YbeD shows structural similarity to
                     small-molecule binding ACT domains |CITS: [15547281]|. In 
                     <i>E. coli</i> BL21(DE3), <i>ybeD</i> expression increases 
                     significantly after a shift from 37&deg;C to 42&deg;C or 
                     46&deg;C |CITS: [30939630]|."
