                     /label=holA
                     /note="Some delta subunits exist independent of the
                     |FRAME: CPLX0-3801|, possibly playing a role in stripping 
                     the |FRAME: CPLX0-3761| from DNA in the absence of the 
                     clamp-loader complex |CITS: [10924523]|. The clamp-loader 
                     complex binds primed ssDNA and loads the &beta; sliding 
                     clamp. Following this, the |FRAME: CPLX0-2361|, linked by 
                     the |FRAME: EG10245-MONOMER tau subunit|, binds, allowing 
                     processive DNA polymerization |CITS: [3316222]|."
