                     presence of detectable oxoprolinase activity in cell 
                     lysates.  A <i>pxpB</i> deletion mutant grows to a lower OD
                     than wild type in minimal medium with ammonium as the sole 
                     source of nitrogen |CITS: [28830929]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>pxpB</i> mutant has aggravating genetic 
                     interactions with genes involved in DNA recombination 
                     |CITS: [26774489]|.
                     PxpB: ""<b>p</b>rokaryotic 5-o<b>x</b>o<b>p</b>rolinase 
                     <b>B</b>"" |CITS: [28830929]|"
