                     /locus_tag="b0770"
                     /product="putative tricarboxylate transporter"
                     /label=ybhI
                     /note="YbhI has 35% sequence identity with the
                     citrate:succinate antiporter, CitT; <I>ybhI</I> is 
                     predicted to encode a tricarboxylic acid transporter 
                     |CITS:[9696764]|. In the Transporter Classification 
                     Database, YbhI is a member of the Divalent 
                     Anion:Na<sup>+</sup> Symporter (DASS) family |CITS: 
                     [26546518]|. Experimental activation of <i>ybhI</i> 
                     expression (by a Tn5 transposase-based system) improves 
                     glycine tolerance |CITS: [40527878]|."
                     /translation="MNKKSLWKLILILAIPCIIGFMPAPAGLSELAWVLFGIYLAAIVG
