                     Cassette (ABC) superfamily |CITS: [26546518]|. 
                     &Delta;<i>ybhF</i> mutants show reduced growth in the 
                     presence of cephalosporin |CITS: [27112147]|. Recombinant, 
                     purified YbhF has ATPase activity |CITS: [32390957]|.
