                     /EC_number="7.4.2.1"
                     /label=artP
                     /note="ArtP is predicted to be the ATP-binding subunit of
                     an L- arginine ABC transporter. Sequence analysis indicates
                     that ArtP is highly homologous to the HisP ATP-binding 
                     protein of the histine/LAO (lysine/arginine/ornithine) ABC 
                     transporter system in <i>Salmonella typhimurium</i>. 
                     <i>artP</i> contains a conserved ATP-binding consensus site
                     |CITS: [8801422]|."
