                     /locus_tag="b0872"
                     /product="NADH oxidoreductase"
                     /label=hcr
                     /note="The <i>hcr</i> gene encodes an NADH oxidoreductase
                     that catalyzes the reduction of the |FRAME: G6457-MONOMER| 
                     (HCP).  The physiological roles of HCP and the 
                     oxidoreductase are not known.  They are detected only 
                     during anaerobic growth in the presence of nitrate and 
                     nitrite |CITS: [10651802]|."
