                     /gene="ybjX"
                     /locus_tag="b0877"
                     /product="DUF535 domain-containing protein YbjX"
                     /label=ybjX
                     /note="<i>ybjX</i> is homologous to <i>somA</i> from 
                     <i>Salmonella enterica</i> serovar Typhimurium (59% 
                     nucleotide homology; 56% protein identity); <i>somA</i> was
                     first identified in a screen for suppressors of a 
                     Salmonella mutant (<I>msbB1::&Omega;tet</i>), that fails to
                     myristoylate lipid A within lipopolysaccharide |CITS: 
                     [11544217]|.
                     <i>ybjX</i> contributes to virulence in Avian pathogenic 
                     <i>E. coli</i> |CITS: [29517278][31326704]|.
                     A <i>ybjX</i> nonsynonymous mutation (YbjX<sub>M73K</sub>) 
                     contributes to colistin resistance in a laboratory evolved 
                     strain |CITS: [35680894]|.
                     "
