                     (rich medium at 37&deg;C) but not in minimal medium or at 
                     low temperature (15&deg;C) |CITS:[15380559]|. YcaM is a 
                     member of the Glutamate:GABA Antiporter (GGA) Family within
                     the Amino Acid-Polyamine-Organocation (APC) Superfamily; 
                     YcaM is a |FRAME: XASA-MONOMER ""GadC""| homolog |CITS: 
                     [24225317]|."
