                     <i>ihfB</i> single deletion mutant strain growing under 
                     anaerobic fermentation conditions were affected relative to
                     responses of the wild-type strain (<i>Escherichia coli</i> 
                     strain BW 25113) grown in the same conditions |CITS: 
                     [28573283]|.
                     Using a method that distinguishes N-phosphorylation from 
                     O-phosphorylation, N-phosphorylation was detected <i>in 
                     vitro</i> |CITS: [33277485]|."
