                     DTEEEAAAVKQAIGDAPFLLVTSASHLPRAMIFFQQEGLNPLPAPANQLAIDSPLNPWE
                     RAIPSPVWLMHSDRVGYETLGRIWQWLKGSSGEPRQE"
