     CDS             1010352..1010915
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="pqiC"
                     /locus_tag="b0952"
                     /product="intermembrane transport lipoprotein PqiC"
                     /label=pqiC
                     /note="PqiC is a periplasmic facing, outer membrane
                     lipoprotein; PqiC interacts with PqiB and the 
                     hetero-oligomer may bridge the inner and outer membrane; 
                     PqiC also forms homo-oligomers |CITS: [27795327]| (see 
                     further |CITS: [ 38228789]|).
                     <i>pqiA, pqiB</i> and <i>pqiC</i> form an operon; 
                     expression of a PqiC-PhoA fusion protein is induced by SoxC
                     when exponentially growing cells are exposed to paraquat 
                     |CITS: [27795327]|.
                     <i>pqiABC</i>, <i>letAB</I> and |FRAME: ABC-45-CPLX 
                     ""<i>mlaFEDCB""|</i> are related loci; <i>pqiABC</i> (and 
                     <i>letAB</I>) are predicted to encode inter-membrane 
                     transport pathways that contribute to membrane integrity; 
                     simultaneous deletion of <i>pqiABC</i> and <i>letAB</I> in 
                     a &Delta;<i>mlaD</i> background increases sensitivity to 
                     EDTA and SDS; expression of <i>pqiABC</i> from a plasmid 
                     complements the SDS-EDTA hypersensitivity of a 
                     &Delta;(<i>mlaD pqiB letB</i>) strain; the substrate for 
                     transport is not known |CITS: [27795327]|."
