     CDS             1031226..1031813
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="hyaD"
                     /locus_tag="b0975"
                     /product="putative hydrogenase 1 maturation protease HyaD"
                     /label=hyaD
                     /note="The HyaD protein is required for the synthesis of
                     active hydrogenase isoenzyme 1 (HYD1) |CITS: [1856178]|. 
                     HyaD is similar to HybD, the maturation protease for 
                     hydrogenase 2 |CITS: [10331925]|.  It is therefore likely 
                     that HyaD is an endopeptidase required for maturation of 
                     hydrogenase 1."
