     CDS             1032205..1033062
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="hyaF"
                     /locus_tag="b0977"
                     /product="protein HyaF"
                     /label=hyaF
                     /note="The HyaF protein appeared to be required for the 
                     synthesis of active hydrogenase isoenzyme 1 (HYD1) |CITS: 
                     [1856178]|.  However, a <i>hyaF</i> in-frame deletion 
                     mutant does not show a serious defect in fumarate-dependent
                     hydrogen oxidation, and hydrogenase 1 appears to be 
                     localized to the membrane correctly |CITS: [DUBINI02]|.
                     Overexpression of <i>hyaF</i> increases the tolerance of 
                     <i>E. coli</i> to n-butanol |CITS: [21408113]|."
