                     /label=flgO
     misc_RNA        1136442..1136519
                     /gene="flgO"
                     /locus_tag="b4826"
                     /product="small RNA FlgO"
                     /note="The Hfq-dependent small RNA FlgO and 4 potential
                     targets were identified by applying a small RNA prediction 
                     algorithm to RIL-seq data |CITS: [34093460]|.
                     FlgO is most highly expressed under iron limitation |CITS: 
                     [34093460]| and during mid-exponential to stationary phase 
                     growth, and its initial transcript appears to undergo 
                     processing |CITS: [37843988]|. However, the expression of 
                     FlgO is diminished in the presence of glucose phosphate 
                     (G6P) |CITS: [37843988]|. Computational analysis suggests 
                     the presence of strong stem-loops at the 3A' end of FlgO 
                     |CITS: [37843988]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [32213244]|"
