                     /locus_tag="b4418"
                     /product="small RNA SraB"
                     /note="SraB is a small RNA of approximately 168 nt in
                     length that is predominantly expressed in late stationary 
                     phase |CITS: [11448770]|.  The RNA chaperone |FRAME: 
                     EG12866-MONOMER ProQ| interacts with SraB |CITS: 
                     [28193673]|.
                     Putative regulators of <i>sraB</i> expression as well as 
                     regulatory targets of SraB have been identified |CITS: 
                     [34327153]|.
                     SraB: ""<b>s</b>mall <b>R</b>N<b>A</b> <b>B</b>"" |CITS: 
                     [11448770]|
                     PsrA4: ""<b>p</b>redicted <b>s</b>mall <b>R</b>N<b>A</b>"" 
                     |CITS: [11448770]|
                     Reviews: |CITS: [12762038][32213244]|"
