                     /product="DUF177 domain-containing protein YceD"
                     /label=yceD
                     /note="YceD is a protein of unknown function |CITS:
                     [2477362]|.  One of the <i>yceD</i> mRNAs is naturally 
                     leaderless.  Toeprinting assays showed that ribosome 
                     binding to the CCU-<i>yceD</i> mRNA is 5-fold decreased 
                     compared to the leaderless <i>yceD</i> mRNA |CITS: 
                     [20971908]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>yceD</i> mutant has no obvious growth defect in
                     rich media, although the 23S rRNA content of the cells 
                     appeared to be decreased |CITS: [27574185]|."
