                     /label=ycfH
     CDS             1152233..1153030
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ycfH"
                     /locus_tag="b1100"
                     /product="putative metal-dependent hydrolase YcfH"
                     /label=ycfH
                     /note="YcfH and YjjV have similarity to the TatD DNase
                     |CITS: [10747959]|.
                     A <i>tatD ycfH yjjV</i> triple mutant does not exhibit 
                     defects in the export of Tat pathway substrates, suggesting
                     that they are not required for the Sec-independent protein 
                     export system in which TatA, TatB, and TatC participate 
                     |CITS: [10747959]|.  A <i>ycfH</i> deletion mutant is more 
                     sensitive to kasugamycin than wild type |CITS: [23308060]|.
                      An in-frame substitution of the <i>holB</i> gene with a 
                     kanamycin resistance gene has no polar effect on 
                     <i>ycfH</i> |CITS: [16083981]|.
                     "
