                     /product="e14 prophage; cell division inhibitor YmfM"
                     /label=ymfM
                     /note="Overexpression of YmfM from a plasmid causes a 
                     filamentous phenotype by inhibiting Z ring formation |CITS:
                     [23565292][33722843]|.  Inhibition of cell division is 
                     independent of SulA, SlmA and MinC and inducible by the SOS
                     response |CITS: [33722843]|.
                     <i>ymfM</i> appears to be identical with the previously 
                     identified <i>sfiC</i> locus |CITS: [33722843]|. 
                     <i>sfiC</i> was previously mapped to the e14 prophage 
                     |CITS: [3531184]|.
