     CDS             1223137..1223463
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ycgL"
                     /locus_tag="b1179"
                     /product="PF05166 family protein YcgL"
                     /label=ycgL
                     /note="YcgL is important for survival under competitive 
                     planktonic growth conditions |CITS: [16849790]|.  A 
                     solution structure
                     of YcgL from the uropathogenic <i>E. coli</i> strain CFT073
                     has been determined |CITS: [17221885]|.
                     Under conditions when the <i>C. elegans</i> gut microbiota 
                     consists of a single <i>E. coli</i> &Delta;<i>ycgL</i> 
                     mutant strain, the life span of the nematode increases by 
                     14% compared to colonization with wild-type <i>E. coli</i> 
                     |CITS: [28622510]|."
