                     /locus_tag="b1217"
                     /product="putative cation transport regulator ChaB"
                     /label=chaB
                     /note="ChaB is predicted to be a regulator of cation
                     transport.  The solution structure of ChaB shows a fold 
                     also found in the cyclin-box family of proteins |CITS: 
                     [15306028]|. ChaB has an important role in maintaining 
                     antibiotic tolerance under starvation; <i>chaB</i> is 
                     upregulated during nutrient starvation and the 
                     starvation-induced ampicillin tolerance levels of a 
                     <i>chaB</i> knockout strain are significantly reduced over 
                     both a 6 and 30 day period |CITS: [34787438]|.
                     "
