                     /product="glutathione-specific
                     gamma-glutamylcyclotransferase"
                     /EC_number="4.3.2.7"
                     /label=chaC
                     /note="ChaC is a &gamma;-glutamylcyclotransferase with 
                     relatively low catalytic efficiency |CITS: [27913623]|. 
                     Expression of <i>chaC</i> enables growth on glutathione of 
                     a mutant yeast organic sulphur auxotroph that can not 
                     utilize glutathione and &gamma;-glu amino acids |CITS: 
                     [23070364]|.
                     A <i>chaC</i> mutant shows a defect in swarming motility, 
                     but no significant defect in swimming motility |CITS: 
                     [17122336]|.
                     "
