                     appears to interact with the CSD system sulfur transfer 
                     protein |FRAME: G7455-MONOMER CsdE| |CITS: [20734996]|. All
                     three subunits of the TusBCD sulfur transfer protein 
                     complex show structural similarity to YchN |CITS: 
                     [16472754]|."
