                     /product="putative patatin-like phospholipase RssA"
                     /label=rssA
                     /note="A non-polar <i>rssA</i> mutant does not exhibit a
                     defect in regulation of RssB or RpoS |CITS: [11566997]|.
                     A point mutation in <i>rssA</i> was one of serveral changes
                     found in a strain evolved for fast growth in glucose.  
                     Inactivation of <i>rssA</i> in the parent strain increased 
                     its specific growth rate in glucose as the sole source of 
                     carbon |CITS: [22884033]|."
