                     /locus_tag="b1248"
                     /product="DUF440 domain-containing protein YciU"
                     /label=yciU
                     /note="YciU was identified in a phylogenetic screen that
                     found proteins containing domains that only occur in 
                     organisms that also contain a |FRAME: EG10204-MONOMER Dam| 
                     methyltransferase |CITS: [16787973]|.
                     In a large genetic interaction screen, <i>yciU</i> showed 
                     genetic interactions with a number of proteins involved in 
                     translation and ribosome biogenesis |CITS: [27732863]|."
