                     /product="DUF892 domain-containing protein YciE"
                     /label=yciE
                     /note="Expression of YciE is induced under osmotic stress 
                     imposed by NaCl in both aerobic and anaerobic conditions 
                     |CITS: [17015655]| and repressed by H-NS |CITS: [8455549]|.
                      The <i>yciGFE</i> locus is expressed poorly |CITS: 
                     [20713450]|.
                     A preliminary X-ray crystallographic analysis of YciE has 
                     been performed |CITS: [15388941]|."
                     /translation="MNRIEHYHDWLRDAHAMEKQAESMLESMASRIDNYPELRARIEQH
                     LSETKNQIVQLETILDRNDISRSVIKDSMSKMAALGQSIGGIFPSDEIVKGSISGYVFE
                     QFEIACYTSLLAAAKNAGDTASIPTIEAILNEEKQMADWLIQNIPQTTEKFLIRSETDG
