                     NAS] [PMID 27297125]"
                     /go_component="plasma membrane [goid 0005886] [evidence
                     IEA] [GO_REF 0000044]"
                     /go_function="protein binding [goid 0005515] [evidence
                     IPI] [PMID 20595257]"
                     /go_process="regulation of cellular response to stress
                     [goid 0080135] [evidence NAS] [PMID 27297125]"
                     /go_process="phage shock [goid 0009271] [evidence IEA]
