                     a D-galactose 1-dehydrogenase |CITS: [12952533]|. However, 
                     this is not consistent with the known biochemistry of <i>E.
                     coli</i>, which metabolizes galactose via the |FRAME: 
                     PWY-6317 ""Leloir pathway""|."
