                     /product="uncharacterized protein YmjD"
                     /label=ymjD
                     /note="The YmjD open reading frame was predicted based on
                     the presence of a ribosome binding site in an intergenic 
                     region.  YmjD shows high sequence similarity to the 
                     amino-terminal portion of an amino acid hydrolase; thus, 
                     this 21 amino acid protein may be a truncated remnant of a 
                     much larger protein.  YmjD is highly expressed during 
                     stationary phase |CITS: [19121005]|."
