                     /note="Expression of YnaL was detected at stationary phase 
                     |CITS: [29645342]|.
                     This gene was first identified as a candidate small RNA 
                     locus, C0343, of approximately 74 nt in length; expression 
                     was observed in minimal glucose medium in early stationary 
                     phase |CITS: [12202758]|.  It was later thought that the 
                     observed microarray signal may represent the 5' UTR of the 
                     <i>dbpA</i> mRNA |CITS: [20070527]|.
                     "
