                     /note="YdaE has an SmtA-like zinc finger region, but no 
                     metallothionein cluster.  YdaE binds one zinc ion which is 
                     coordinated by four cysteine residues |CITS: [12207707]|."
                     /translation="MTKKIKCAYHLCKKDVEESKAIERMLHFMHGILSKDEPRKYCSEA
