                     /note="Though under typical laboratory growth conditions
                     OmpN is not highly expressed, when overexpressed
                     it operates as a porin with single-channel conductance 
                     properties similar to those of OmpC |CITS: [9642192]|. OmpN
                     abundance is regulated by |FRAME: TKE8-RNA|. <i>ompN</i> 
                     exhibits mosaic evolution patterns in <i>E. coli</i> |CITS:
                     [40444982]|."
