     CDS             1451754..1452521
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="paaF"
                     /locus_tag="b1393"
                     /product="trifunctional putative 2,3-dehydroadipyl-CoA
                     hydratase / 2,3-dehydroadipyl-CoA hydratase / PaaF-PaaG 
                     hydratase-isomerase complex"
                     /label=paaF
                     /note="PaaF is a predicted 2,3-dehydroadipyl-CoA hydratase 
                     involved in phenylacetate catabolism. The enzyme from 
                     <i>Pseudomonas</i> sp. strain Y2 has been biochemically 
                     characterized |CITS: [20660314]|.
                     A <i>paaF</i> mutant exhibits a defect in utilization of 
