                     /label=ydbD
     CDS             1469401..1471707
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ydbD"
                     /locus_tag="b1407"
                     /product="DUF2773 domain-containing protein YdbD"
                     /label=ydbD
                     /note="YdbD may play a role in detoxification of
                     methylglyoxal (MG) and dihydroxyacetone (DHA).
                     A <i>ydbD</i> insertion mutant increases the sensitivity of
                     a <i>gloA</i> mutant to MG and DHA.  A strain containing
                     only the <i>ydbD</i> insertion mutation does not show 
                     increased sensitivity to MG or DHA |CITS: [17846588]|. 
                     Expression of <i>ydbD</i> is increased 7.6-fold by 
                     treatment with NO, but it does not appear to play a role in
                     protection against NO |CITS: [15546870]|."
