     CDS             1481492..1482292
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ydcF"
                     /locus_tag="b1414"
                     /product="DUF218 domain-containing protein YdcF"
                     /label=ydcF
                     /note="The function of YdcF is unknown.  Evidence from
                     structure and expression analysis suggests that YdcF is an 
                     <i>S</i>-adenosylmethionine-dependent enzyme which may play
                     a role in anaerobic respiration |CITS: [18393394]|.
                     A crystal structure of YdcF has been solved at 1.8 &Aring; 
                     resolution.  The protein fold shows some similarity to the 
                     adenine nucleotide &alpha; hydrolase-like family; thus, 
                     adenosine-containing compounds were screened for binding. 
                     <i>S</i>-adenosylmethionine binds with a dissociation 
                     constant of 25 &micro;M |CITS: [18393394]|.
                     "
