                     /note="The <i>hokB/mokB/sokB</i> locus of <i>E. coli</i>
                     K-12 encodes an intact hok/sok toxin/antitoxin system 
                     |CITS: [10361310]|.
                     MokB: ""<b>m</b>ediation <b>o</b>f <b>k</b>illing 
                     <b>B</b>"" |CITS: [10361310]|"
