     CDS             complement(1511356..1511451)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yncL"
                     /locus_tag="b4598"
                     /product="uncharacterized protein YncL"
                     /label=yncL
                     /note="The <i>yncL</i> open reading frame contains a
                     predicted transmembrane segment |CITS: [19121005]|. The 
                     majority of YncL partitions into the inner membrane 
                     fraction using a sucrose fractionation protocol |CITS: 
                     [21778229]|.  <i>yncL</i> mRNA has been detected; the mRNA 
                     exhibits some interaction with Hfq protein |CITS: 
                     [11445539]|.
                     Expression of <i>yncL</i> was detected during stationary 
                     phase |CITS: [11445539][19121005]|, is higher in minimal 
                     glucose medium than in rich medium, and increases upon heat
                     shock |CITS: [19734316]|."
