                     /product="L-asparagine transporter"
                     /label=ansP
                     /note="AnsP is a probable L-asparagine transporter. The 
                     equivalent gene to <I>ansP</I> in <I>Salmonella 
                     enterica</I> has been expressed and shown to confer 
                     L-asparagine uptake |CITS: [7894705]|. AnsP is a member of 
                     the Amino Acid-Polyamine-Organocation (APC) superfamily of 
                     transporters |CITS: [26546518]| and probably functions as 
                     an L-asparagine:proton symporter."
