                     /locus_tag="b1472"
                     /product="putative uncharacterized protein YddL"
                     /label=yddL
                     /note="In the EcoGene database |CITS: [23197660]|,
                     <i>yddL</i> is annotated as a pseudogene: ""An intact 
                     allele is found in O157:H7 as Z2239 (UniProtKB: Q8XAS0). A 
                     deletion has apparently removed the 3' 273 codons of 
                     yddL.""
                     In two GenBank entries, the gene is referred to as a 
                     ""putative uncharacterized lipoprotein"" and as an ""outer 
                     membrane &Beta;-barrel protein. Based on co-occurrence 
                     literature analysis among <i>E. coli</i> K-12 strains in 
                     addition to genomic co-localization and sequence analysis, 
                     the function of <i>yddL</i> is hypothesized to be related 
                     to membrane permeability of solutes in response to osmotic 
                     shifts |CITS: [36855185]|."
