                     /note="Based on sequence similarity <i>lsrB</i> is
                     predicted to encode the periplasmic binding protein of an 
                     AI-2 ABC transporter |CITS: [15601708]|.
                     <i>lsrB</i> is overexpressed in <I>E. coli</i> biofilms 
                     compared to planktonic growth in exponential phase |CITS: 
                     [14731270]|.
                     LsrB binds the chemically synthesized probe 
                     D-desthiobiotin-AI-2 |CITS: [31470199]|.
                     A <i>&Delta;lsrB::aphA</i> strain is impaired in biofilm 
                     formation |CITS: [14731270]|."
