                     /product="uncharacterized protein YdgU"
                     /label=ydgU
                     /note="The YdgU open reading frame was predicted based on
                     the presence of a ribosome binding site in an intergenic 
                     region. YdgU contains a predicted transmembrane segment. 
                     YdgU is expressed during stationary phase |CITS: 
                     [19121005]|.
                     <i>ydgU</i> was in the top 20 genes with increased 
                     translation in response to extreme acid stress (pH 4.4 
                     compared to pH 7.6) as measured by ribosome coverage of its
                     transcripts using RNA-Seq |CITS: [37909716]|."
