                     /label=ydgD
     CDS             1666217..1667038
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ydgD"
                     /locus_tag="b1598"
                     /product="putative serine protease YdgD"
                     /label=ydgD
                     /note="YdgD is a predicted periplasmic serine protease
                     that may be involved in cell envelope protein quality 
                     control |CITS: [22505681]|.  Sequence similarity suggests 
                     that it may contain &beta;-barrel structure(s) |CITS: 
                     [12192075]|.
                     A <i>ydgD</i> single mutant does not have a phenotype under
                     the tested conditions; however, a |FRAME: EG10760 
                     <i>tsp</i>| <i>ydgD</i> double mutant does not grow in the 
                     presence of SDS/EDTA at either 37 or 42&deg;C and shows 
                     increased membrane permeability.  Expression of <i>rpoE</i>
                     is induced 2.3-fold, and expression of <i>spy</i> is 
                     induced 4.3-fold in the <i>tsp ydgD</i> double mutant 
                     |CITS: [22505681]|."
