                     /product="putative transporter YdhP"
                     /label=ydhP
                     /note="In the Transporter Classification Database, YdhP is
                     an uncharacterised member of the Drug:H+ Antiporter-1 (12 
                     Spanner) (DHA1) Family within the Major Facilitator 
                     Superfamily (MFS) |CITS: [9529885][26546518]|. BACTH 
                     (Bacterial Adenylate Cyclase Two-Hybrid System) assays 
                     indicate that YdhP interacts with the proline:H<sup>+</sup>
                     symporter |FRAME: CPLX0-7642 ""ProP""|; labelled YdhP 
                     concentrates at the cell poles in a cardiolipin independent
                     manner; deleting <i>ydhP</i> does not affect ProP function 
                     or localization |CITS: [29280215]|."
