                     /gene="ydhY"
                     /locus_tag="b1674"
                     /product="putative 4Fe-4S ferredoxin-like protein YdhY"
                     /label=ydhY
                     /note="YdhY is a predicted ferredoxin-like protein.  Based
                     on sequence similarity, the <i>ydhYVWXUT</i> operon may 
                     encode components of an oxidoreductase |CITS: [18227264]|. 
                     Expression of <i>ydhY</i> is increased under anaerobic 
                     growth conditions, dependent on FNR |CITS: [15659690]|, and
                     repressed by nitrate and nitrite |CITS: 
                     [16377617][18227264]|.  Expression of <i>ydhY</i> displayed
                     significantly lower variability across populations adapted 
                     to different toxins |CITS: [28217741]|.  A <i>ydhY-T</i> 
                     mutant does not show a growth defect under anaerobic 
                     conditions, although utilization of certain sources of 
                     sulfur is impaired |CITS: [18227264]|.
                     "
