     CDS             1763331..1764443
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ydiK"
                     /locus_tag="b1688"
                     /product="putative transporter YdiK"
                     /label=ydiK
                     /note="YdiK is predicted to be an inner membrane protein
                     with eight transmembrane domains; topology analysis 
                     suggests that the C-terminus is located in the cytoplasm 
                     |CITS: [15919996]|. In the Transporter Classification 
                     Database |CITS: [24225317]|, YdiK (from strain <i>E. 
                     coli</i> SMS-3-5) is a member of the Autoinducer-2 Exporter
                     (AI-2E) Family (2.A.86) (see also |CITS: [ 32457721]|).
                     <i>ydiK</i> is a member of the |FRAME: PC00033 ""PurR""| 
                     regulon |CITS: [12391881][21572102]|."
