                     /gene="ydiN"
                     /locus_tag="b1691"
                     /product="putative transporter YdiN"
                     /label=ydiN
                     /note="In the Transporter Classification Database, YdiN is
                     an uncharacterised member of the Aromatic Acid:H+ Symporter
                     (AAHS) Family within the Major Facilitator Superfamily 
                     (MFS) |CITS: [9529885][26546518]|.
                     YdiN is predicted to be an inner membrane protein with 
                     twelve transmembrane domains; topology analysis suggests 
                     the C-terminus is located in the cytoplasm |CITS: 
                     [15919996]|.
                     Expression of <i>ydiN</i> is induced under carbon-limited 
                     conditions in a shikimate-producing strain |CITS: 
                     [16828913]|."
