                     /product="putative aldose 1-epimerase YeaD"
                     /label=yeaD
                     /note="Overexpression of <i>yeaD</i> slightly increases
                     fitness as well as resistance to the antibiotic aztreonam 
                     |CITS: [21173244]| and suppresses the essentiality of 
                     |FRAME: EG12691-MONOMER ""<i>lapB</i>""|, which encodes a 
                     protein involved in lipopolysaccharide (LPS) assembly 
                     |CITS: [24722986]|.
                     The YeaD protein has been crystallized |CITS: [20693678]|. 
                     Sequence similarity suggests that YeaD may contain 
                     &beta;-barrel structure(s) |CITS: [12192075]|."
