                     /locus_tag="b1784"
                     /label=yeaH
     CDS             1863212..1864495
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yeaH"
                     /locus_tag="b1784"
                     /product="DUF444 domain-containing protein YeaH"
                     /label=yeaH
                     /note="YeaH plays a role in the adaptation to sustained
                     nitrogen starvation |CITS: [26621053]|.
                     The |FRAME: CPLX0-1461|-dependent |FRAME: RYEB-RNA| was 
                     found to downregulate the translation of |FRAME: 
                     G6969-MONOMER| and YeaH under long term (24 hrs) N-starved 
                     conditions. Recovery from N-starvation has a shorter lag 
                     time in <i>&Delta;yeaG</i>, <i>&Delta;yeaH</i> and 
                     <i>&Delta;yeaG&Delta;yeaH</i> mutants, whereas a longer lag
                     time was observed in <i>&Delta;sdsR</i> mutants; thus, SdsR
                     translational downregulation of YeaG and YeaH allows for 
                     optimal recovery from N-starvation |CITS: [38142457]|."
