     CDS             1873030..1873128
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yoaK"
                     /locus_tag="b4676"
                     /product="uncharacterized membrane protein YoaK"
                     /label=yoaK
                     /note="The <i>YoaK</i> open reading frame was predicted
                     based on sequence similarity to a number of other enteric 
                     bacteria.  YoaK contains a predicted transmembrane segment,
                     and the protein can be found in the membrane fraction 
                     |CITS: [19121005][21778229]|.  YoaK is highly expressed 
                     during exponential growth and stationary phase |CITS: 
                     [19121005]|. Topology assays using GFP and PhoA fusion 
                     proteins suggest that YoaK may have a dual orientation 
                     within the membrane |CITS: [21778229]|. Translocation of 
                     YoaK is impaired in YidC-depleted <i>E. coli</i> strains 
                     |CITS: [21778229]|."
