                     /product="DUF1869 domain-containing protein YoaG"
                     /label=yoaG
                     /note="A <i>yoaG</i> mutant is more sensitive to hydrogen 
                     peroxide and cadmium than wild type and shows increased 
                     biofilm formation compared to wild type |CITS: [19919618]|.
                     <i>yoaG</i> is thought to form an operon together with 
                     <i>yeaR</i>.  Transcription of <i>yoaG</i> is induced in 
                     response to nitrate |CITS: [16377617]|; <i>yeaR</i> 
                     transcription was also shown to be induced in response to 
                     nitrite |CITS: [16377617][17720788]| and nitric oxide 
                     |CITS: [15546870]|.
                     "
