     gene            complement(1884208..1884789)
                     /gene="yeaY"
                     /locus_tag="b1806"
                     /label=yeaY
     CDS             complement(1884208..1884789)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yeaY"
                     /locus_tag="b1806"
                     /product="Slp family lipoprotein YeaY"
                     /label=yeaY
                     /note="YeaY is a verified lipoprotein according to
                     unpublished data by S. Matsuyama et al. (cited in |CITS: 
                     [12876315]|).
                     YeaY contains a signal sequence characteristic of bacterial
                     lipoproteins followed by a characteristic Cys residue at 
                     position 23 which could serve as the lipid attachment site 
                     |CITS: [12900013]|.  YeaY shows significant sequence 
                     similarity to an outer membrane lipoprotein encoded by the 
                     carbon starvation-inducible and stationary phase-inducible 
                     <i>slp</i> gene in <i>E. coli</i> |CITS: [8022277]|.
                     <i>yeaY</i> is a member of the &sigma;<sup>E</sup> regulon 
                     |CITS: [12900013]|."
