                     /label=yoaC
                     /note="A knockout mutant of this gene was hypersensitive
                     to boric acid exposure compared to other gene knockouts; a 
                     complementation assay restored its intrinsic boric acid 
                     resistance. Double and triple knockout mutants 
                     (<i>&Delta;yoaC&Delta;|FRAME: G7261|, &Delta;|FRAME: 
                     G6253|&Delta;|FRAME: EG12760|&Delta;yoaC and 
                     &Delta;yfeS&Delta;yoaC&Delta;garP</i>) exhibited increasing
                     sensitivity, respectively |CITS: [38466471]|."
