                     /note="YecM has structural similarity to metal-binding 
                     isomerases and oxygenases |CITS: [12660999]|.  Protein 
                     surface analysis showed highest similarity to zinc metal 
                     binding surfaces |CITS: [16322579]|.
                     YecM was identified in a phylogenetic screen that found 
                     proteins containing domains that only occur in organisms 
                     that also contain a |FRAME: EG10204-MONOMER Dam| 
                     methyltransferase |CITS: [16787973]|."
