                     /locus_tag="b4839"
                     /product="small antisense RNA AsflhD"
                     /note="AsflhD is a small antisense regulatory RNA that
                     affects genes related to motility through the repression of
                     the transcriptional regulator FhlD |CITS: [36000733]|. 
                     AsflhD and FlhD are cleaved at specific sites by the 
                     endonucleases RNase III, and the complex AsflhD/FlhD is 
                     completely degraded by the endonuclease |CITS: 
                     [36000733]|."
