                     /note="The <i>yecJ</i> ORF contains an out-of-frame
                     internal translation initiation site immediately followed 
                     by a stop codon.  The start codon seems to be operational 
                     <i>in vivo</i>.  When the internal start codon is mutated, 
                     the efficiency of translation of the <i>yecJ</i> ORF 
                     increases |CITS: [30904393]|."
