                     /note="<i>tcyN</i> encodes the ATP binding subunit of a
                     cystine ABC transporter complex |CITS: 
                     [11421275][25139244]|. TcyN contains sequence motifs 
                     conserved in ATP-binding cassette (ABC) proteins |CITS: 
                     [9593292][25837721]|. TcyN is upregulated in response to 
                     exogenous L-threonine stress (100-500 mM L-threonine); 
                     expression of <i>tcyN</i> from a multicopy plasmid 
                     increases the resistance of wild-type <i>E. coli</i> to 
                     high concentrations of L-threonine; expression of 
                     <i>tcyN</i> from a multicopy plasmid increases L-threonine 
                     production in L-threonine producing strains of <i>E. 
                     coli</i> |CITS: [28911185]|."
