     gene            complement(1995393..1995587)
                     /gene="fliX"
                     /locus_tag="b4827"
                     /label=fliX
     misc_RNA        complement(1995393..1995587)
                     /gene="fliX"
                     /locus_tag="b4827"
                     /product="small RNA FliX"
                     /note="The Hfq-dependent small RNA FliX and 17 potential
                     targets were identified by applying a small RNA prediction 
                     algorithm to RIL-seq data |CITS: [34093460]|.
                     FliX is highly expressed during exponential growth and 
                     under iron limitation |CITS: [34093460][37843988]|. 
                     However, in the presence of glucose phosphate (G6P), the 
                     expression of FliX is notably reduced|CITS:[37843988]|. 
                     Conversely, FliX exhibits increased expression in a minimal
                     medium enriched with ribose or galactose |CITS: 
                     [37843988]|. Computational analysis indicates the presence 
                     of strong stem-loops at the 3' end of FliX |CITS: 
                     [37843988]|. When FliX is overexpressed, a decrease in the 
                     number of flagella and bacterial motility is observed 
                     |CITS: [37843988]|. RIL-seq analysis unveils the regulatory
                     impact of FliX on potential targets, primarily associated 
                     with ribosomal proteins and genes within the late and 
                     middle stages of the flagellar regulon |CITS: [37843988]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [32213244]|"
