                     0044781] [evidence IEA] [GO_REF 0000043]"
                     /go_process="bacterial-type flagellum-dependent cell
                     motility [goid 0071973] [evidence IBA] [GO_REF 0000033]"
                     /go_process="bacterial-type flagellum-dependent cell
                     motility [goid 0071973] [evidence IMP] [PMID 25350000]"
