     CDS             2002960..2003193
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yedF"
                     /locus_tag="b1930"
                     /product="putative sulfurtransferase YedF"
                     /label=yedF
                     /note="YedF shows sequence similarity to the sulfur
                     transfer protein TusA; however, unlike TusA, YedF does not 
                     appear to function in molybdenum cofactor assembly |CITS: 
                     [23281480]|.
                     Structural characterization of YedF has been performed by 
                     NMR.  The protein exhibits a two-layered &alpha;-&beta; 
                     sandwich-type fold and shows structural similarity to 
                     translation initiation factor 3, indicating that the 
                     protein might
                     bind RNA |CITS: [11854485]|.  YedF is soluble and has 31% 
                     identity to TusA |CITS: [11854485]|."
                     /translation="MKNIVPDYRLDMVGEPCPYPAVATLEAMPQLKKGEILEVVSDCPQ
                     SINNIPLDARNHGYTVLDIQQDGPTIRYLIQK"
                     /go_component="cytosol [goid 0005829] [evidence IEA] [PMID
