     CDS             complement(join(2004704..2004838,2004844..2005521,
                     2005521..2005832))
                     /pseudo
                     /gene="yedN"
                     /locus_tag="b4495"
                     /product="putative type III secreted effector, N-terminal
                     fragment"
                     /label=yedN
                     /note="No information about this protein was found by a 
                     literature search conducted on June 21, 2017.
                     This ORF is now thought to represent the N-terminal part of
                     the <i>yedN</i> pseudogene.
                     Comment and note from ASAP:
                     The coordinates of yedN have been changed from those 
                     reported in the GenBank entry (GBAN:U00096.2) to correspond
                     to the region of similarity to Escherichia coli EDL933 
                     (ASAP:ABH-0026761), adding 482 nucleotides to the 
                     N-terminus and 131 nucleotides to the C-terminus.
                     A single nucleotide deletion within codon 105 relative to 
                     espR4 in Escherichia coli EDL933 (EHEC) (ASAP:ABH-0026761) 
                     results in a frameshift leading to termination after codon 
                     116. Additional defects include a single nucleotide 
                     substitution at g.2009575 that results in a termination 
                     codon and a second single nucleotide deletion within or 
                     after the codon that corresponds to position 331 that 
                     produces an additional frameshift."
