                     /note="Transcription is induced by nalidixic acid, but not
                     by mitomycin C,
                     and induction does not require LexA |CITS: [11544210]|. 
                     <I>intG</I> clustered with chemotaxis, flagellum, and 
                     fimbria genes in increased expression after
                     long-term adaptation to propionate and acetate 
                     |CITS:[12620868]|."
