                     flagellar export assembly apparatus"
                     /label=fliI
                     /note="FliI is a cytoplasmic component of the flagellar
                     export apparatus and serves as the ATPase of the apparatus,
                     providing the energy for translocation
                     of export substrates across the cytoplasmic membrane 
                     |CITS:[8943245]|.
