     CDS             2050339..2051055
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yeeN"
                     /locus_tag="b1983"
                     /product="putative transcriptional regulator YeeN"
                     /label=yeeN
                     /note="In a study of the <i>E. coli</i> complexome, YeeN
                     was found in a cytoplasmic complex together with YeeZ 
                     |CITS: [16858726]|.
                     A <i>yeeN</i> mutant has a cold-sensitive phenotype |CITS: 
                     [10572302]| and is more sensitive to nalidixic acid and 
                     kasugamycin than wild type |CITS: [23308060]|.
                     YeeN was transcriptionally upregulated in iron limitation 
                     over iron excess at 63% dissolved oxygen as determined by 
                     RNA-seq |CITS:[ 35777694]|."
