                     /label=yeeA
                     /note="YeeA is predicted to be an inner membrane protein
                     with six transmembrane domains; topology analysis suggests 
                     the C-terminus is located in the cytoplasm |CITS: 
                     [15919996]|. In the Transporter Classification Database, 
                     YeeA has been renamed FusC (<U>fus</U>aric acid resistance 
                     protein) and is a member of the aromatic acid exporter 
                     (AaAE) family |CITS: [26546518]|."
