                     /product="bifunctional lipid kinase YegS / lipid kinase"
                     /label=yegS
                     /note="YegS is a lipid kinase with phosphatidylglycerol
                     kinase activity <i>in vitro</i> |CITS: [17351295]|.  It 
                     shows sequence
                     similarity to a family of eukaryotic non-protein kinases 
                     |CITS: [16511327]|.  The physiological role of YegS is 
                     unknown,
                     but a possible role in the response to acid stress has been
                     proposed |CITS: [17351295]|.
                     A crystal structure of YegS has been determined at 1.9 
                     &Aring; resolution; the protein shows structural similarity
                     to a
                     family of NAD kinases |CITS: [16511327][17351295]|.
                     In an experimental evolution experiment for growth under 
                     glucose limitation in a chemostat, inactivation of 
                     <i>yegS</i> conferred an increase in fitness |CITS: 
                     [23822838]|.
                     "
