                     /note="The YegT protein is an uncharacterised member of
                     the Nucleoside:H<sup>+</sup> Symporter (NHS) family within 
                     the Major Facilitator Superfamily (MFS) of transporters 
                     |CITS: [9529885][26546518]|. The products of <i>yegT, 
                     yegU</i>, and <i>yegV</i> are implicated in glycogen 
                     accumulation |CITS: [38257942]|."
