                     /label=preT
     CDS             2227512..2228750
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="preT"
                     /locus_tag="b2146"
                     /product="multifunctional dihydropyrimidine dehydrogenase
                     (NAD(+)) subunit PreT / dihydropyrimidine dehydrogenase 
                     (NAD(+)) / 5-fluorodihydrouracil dehydrogenase (NAD(+)) / 
                     dihydrouracil dehydrogenase (NAD(+)) / dihydrothymine 
                     dehydrogenase (NAD(+))"
                     /EC_number="1.3.1.1"
                     /label=preT
                     /note="PreT was shown to form a complex with PreA; PreAT
                     has NAD<sup>+</sup>-dependent dihydropyrimidine 
                     dehydrogenase activity |CITS: 
                     [16858726][18482579][34097066]|.  PreT is expected to be 
                     the FAD-binding subunit |CITS: [34097066]|.
                     Based on sequence similarity, PreT was predicted to be a 
                     dihydrothymine dehydrogenase or glutamate synthase |CITS: 
                     [12952533][11574054]|.  PreT has similarity to the 
                     N-terminal half of mammalian dihydropyrimidine 
                     dehydrogenase |CITS: [18482579]|.
