                     /product="trifunctional periplasmic nitrate reductase
                     cytochrome c550 protein / periplasmic nitrate reductase / 
                     nitrate reductase (cytochrome)"
                     /EC_number="1.9.6.1"
                     /label=napB
                     /note="The |FRAME: EG12061| gene encodes the periplasmic
                     diheme cytochrome c<sub>550</sub> component of the 
                     periplasmic nitrate reductase.  It receives electrons from 
                     the membrane-bound |FRAME: EG12060 NapC| protein and passes
                     them to the |FRAME: EG12067 NapA| catalytic subunit |CITS: 
                     [8039676][8842153][8830238][8919448]| (and see |CITS: 
                     [22842521]|.  <i>E. coli</i> NapA and NapB proteins do not 
                     purify as a heterodimeric complex |CITS: [17130127]|."
