     gene            complement(2300451..2302094)
                     /gene="yojI"
                     /locus_tag="b2211"
                     /label=yojI
     CDS             complement(2300451..2302094)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yojI"
                     /locus_tag="b2211"
                     /product="ABC transporter family protein / microcin J25
                     efflux protein"
                     /label=yojI
                     /note="YojI is a member of the ABC superfamily of
                     transporters |CITS:[9873074]|. Sequence analysis suggests 
                     that <i>yojI</i> encodes an ABC-type exporter |CITS: 
                     [9533881]| with six hydrophobic transmembrane segments and 
                     a single nucleotide-binding domain |CITS: 
                     [11566977][9593292]|.
                     Overexpression of <i>yojI</i> from a plasmid vector confers
                     resistance to the peptide antibiotic, microcin J25; this 
                     resistance phenotype is abolished when a <i>tolC</i> null 
                     allele is present suggesting that YojI and TolC are 
                     components of an efflux system that can export microcin 
                     J25; YojI can substitute for McjD, the natural, plasmid 
                     encoded microcin J25 exporter |CITS: [15866933]|.
                     Expression of <i>yojI</i> is upregulated by guanosine 
                     3',5'-bispyrophosphate (ppGpp) |CITS: [18408024]|. The 
                     transcriptional regulator, Lrp, upregulates <i>yojI</i> 
                     expression |CITS: [19074390]|.
                     <i>yojI</i> is one of 35 efflux-encoding genes that have 
                     been deleted or inactivated in 'Efflux KnockOut-35' 
                     (EKO-35) -  a K-12 BW25133-derived strain that lacks 35 
                     efflux pumps and can be used as a platform to study their 
                     function |CITS: [36065018][36318669]|."
