     gene            complement(2333896..2337648)
                     /gene="yfaL"
                     /locus_tag="b2233"
                     /label=yfaL
     CDS             complement(2333896..2337648)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfaL"
                     /locus_tag="b2233"
                     /product="putative autotransporter adhesin YfaL"
                     /label=yfaL
                     /note="<i>yfaL</i> has homology with |FRAME: G7080
                     <i>flu</i>| - encoding the autotransporter (AT) 
                     self-recognizing adhesin Ag43; deletion of <i>yfaL</i> has 
                     no significant effect on adhesion properties in microtiter 
                     plate assays or on biofilm formation however increased 
                     expression of <i>yfaL</i> results in increased adhesion and
                     increased biofilm formation compared to the wild-type; 
                     overexpression of <i>yfaL</i> promotes bacterial adhesion 
                     to microtiter PVC plates to a greater level than 
                     overexpression of <i>flu</i> |CITS: [15659678]|.  A 
                     <i>yfaL</i> deletion mutant is 6-fold more sensitive to 
                     UV-radiation than wild type |CITS: [27718375]|. <i>yfaL</i>
                     exhibits mosaic evolution patterns in <i>E. coli</i> |CITS:
                     [40444982]|."
