     gene            2341993..2342247
                     /gene="yfaE"
                     /locus_tag="b2236"
                     /label=yfaE
     CDS             2341993..2342247
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfaE"
                     /locus_tag="b2236"
                     /product="ferredoxin-like diferric-tyrosyl radical
                     cofactor maintenance protein YfaE"
                     /label=yfaE
                     /note="YfaE is a [2Fe-2S] cluster-containing protein that
                     is involved in maintenance and possibly in the biosynthesis
                     of active |FRAME: B2-CPLX ""NrdB &beta;<sub>2</sub> 
                     subunit""| containing the diferric-tyrosyl radical 
                     (Y&middot;) cofactor within ribonucleotide reductase |CITS:
                     [17880186][18314964]|. YfaE is required for the activity of
                     &beta; during redox stress at high Mn<sup>2+</sup> 
                     conditions and may provide metal specificity to NrdB |CITS:
                     [21338418]|.
                     YfaE was purified from inclusion bodies and 
                     refolded/reassembled by addition of Fe<sup>2+</sup>, 
                     Fe<sup>3+</sup> and sulfide under anaerobic conditions. The
                     oxidized form of YfaE is not stable and forms aggregates 
                     |CITS: [17880186]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>yfaE</i> mutant has aggravating genetic 
                     interactions with genes involved in DNA metabolism |CITS: 
                     [26774489]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [21371140]|"
                     /translation="MARVTLRITGTQLLCQDEHPSLLAALESHNVAVEYQCREGYCGSC
