     gene            2359389..2360546
                     /gene="arnB"
                     /locus_tag="b2253"
                     /label=arnB
     CDS             2359389..2360546
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="arnB"
                     /locus_tag="b2253"
                     /product="UDP-4-amino-4-deoxy-L-arabinose
                     aminotransferase"
                     /EC_number="2.6.1.87"
                     /label=arnB
                     /note="ArnB is a UDP-L-Ara4O C-4"" transaminase |CITS: 
                     [12704196]| that acts in a pathway which modifies lipid A 
                     phosphates with 4-amino-4-deoxy-L-arabinose (L-Ara4N), 
                     causing increased resistance to polymyxin |CITS: 
                     [11706007]|.
                     Structural and biochemical characterization of 
                     <i>Salmonella typhimurium</i> ArnB has been performed; 
                     crystal structures of the enzyme are presented and 
                     discussed with respect to catalysis |CITS: [12429098]|. 
                     Expression of <i>arnB</i> is induced by the presence of 
                     FeSO<sub>4</sub> (which primarily yields oxidized ferric 
                     iron in solution); the effect is dependent on the presence 
                     of the BasS-BasR two-component system |CITS: 
                     [15322361][16428424]|. Fe(III) promotes transcription of 
                     the BasR activated <i>arn</i> operon and polymyxin 
                     resistance in <i>E. coli</i> K-12 |CITS: [15569938]|. 
                     Chromosomal expression of the <i>Salmonella typhimurium</i>
                     <i>pmrD</i> gene enables <i>E. coli</i> K-12 to induce the 
                     BasR activated <i>arn</i> operon and promotes resistance to
                     polymyxin B during growth in a low Mg<sup>2+</sup> 
                     environment |CITS: [15569938]|
                     ArnB: ""L-<b>Ar</b>a4<b>N</b> (4-amino-4-deoxy-L-arabinose)
                     biosynthesis"" |CITS: [11706007]|
                     PmrH: ""<b>p</b>oly<b>m</b>yxin <b>r</b>esistance"" Review:
                     |CITS: [17362200]|"
