     CDS             2363497..2364387
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="arnD"
                     /locus_tag="b2256"
                     /product="bifunctional putative 
                     4-deoxy-4-formamido-L-arabinose-phosphoundecaprenol 
                     deformylase ArnD / undecaprenyl phosphate-alpha-L-ara4FN 
                     deformylase"
                     /label=arnD
                     /note="ArnD is predicted to act as a deformylase that
                     removes the formyl group from undecaprenyl 
                     phosphate-L-Ara4FN |CITS: [15695810][17928292]|.
                     Deletion of <i>arnD</i> results in restoration of polymyxin
                     sensitivity in a polymyxin-resitant <i>pmrA<sup>c</sup></i>
                     strain |CITS: [17928292]|. Expression of the 
                     <i>arnBCADTEF</i> operon increased during growth with 
                     elevated FeSO<sub>4</sub>, FeCl<sub>3</sub>, or 
                     ZnSO<sub>4</sub> and was dependent upon the BasSR 
                     two-component signal transduction system |CITS: 
                     [15322361][15659689]|."
