                     /product="colicin V production protein"
                     /label=cvpA
                     /note="CvpA is required for wild-type production of
                     colicin V from an episomal gene |CITS: [2542219]|.
                     A mutant exhibits a defect in production of colicin V from 
                     an episomal gene |CITS: [2542219]|.  A mutant exhibits 
                     adenine auxotrophy |CITS: [2542219]|.
                     CvpA has similarity to a <i>Pseudomonas aeruginosa</i> 
                     protein |CITS: [11145267]|.
                     Regulation has been described |CITS: [3040734]|.
                     CvpA: ""colicin V production"" |CITS: [2542219]|."
