                     /locus_tag="b2317"
                     /label=dedA
     CDS             complement(2427561..2428220)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="dedA"
                     /locus_tag="b2317"
                     /product="DedA family protein DedA"
                     /label=dedA
                     /note="DedA is predicted to be an inner membrane protein
                     with four transmembrane domains; topology analysis suggests
                     the C-terminus is located in the cytoplasm |CITS: 
                     [15919996]|.
                     DedA is a member of the DedA family of proteins |CITS: 
                     [23086209]|. <i>E. coli</i> K-12 contains 7 other DedA 
                     family members, namely |FRAME: G7609-MONOMER ""YqjA""|, 
                     |FRAME: EG11824 ""YghB""|, |FRAME: EG11571 ""YabI""|, 
                     |FRAME: EG12017 ""YohD""|, |FRAME: G7407 ""YqaA""|, |FRAME:
                     G6945-MONOMER ""YdjX""| and |FRAME: G6947 ""YdjZ""|.  
                     Collectively, the DedA family is essential in <i>E. 
                     coli</i> K-12 |CITS: [22301910]|.
                     DedA: ""<b>d</b>ownstream <i><b>E</b>. coli</i> <b>D</b>NA 
                     (from <i>hisT</i>)"" |CITS: [3040734]|"
