     CDS             2431429..2432424
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="flk"
                     /locus_tag="b2321"
                     /product="putative flagella assembly protein"
                     /label=flk
                     /note="Flk belongs to the heterogeneous group of
                     C-tail-anchored membrane proteins (TAMPs) |CITS: 
                     [20406421][29246766]|. The C-terminal transmembrane domain 
                     is able to target a soluble reporter protein to the inner 
                     membrane where it is inserted in the expected C-out N-in 
                     orientation; mislocalization of the reporter protein occurs
                     in strains that are lacking or depleted in SRP, FtsY, DnaK 
                     or YidC but not in strains lacking trigger factor or YajC; 
                     the transmembrane domain of the reporter protein 
                     cross-links to Ffh, trigger factor, YidC and YajC <i>in 
                     vivo</i> |CITS: [29246766]|."
