     gene            complement(2438230..2439039)
                     /gene="yfcA"
                     /locus_tag="b2327"
                     /label=yfcA
     CDS             complement(2438230..2439039)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfcA"
                     /locus_tag="b2327"
                     /product="putative transporter YfcA"
                     /label=yfcA
                     /note="YfcA is predicted to be an inner membrane protein
                     with seven transmembrane domains; experimental topology 
                     analysis suggests the C terminus is in the periplasm |CITS:
                     [15919996]|.
                     <i>yfcA</i> shows differential codon adaptation, resulting 
                     in differential translation efficiency signatures, in 
                     thermophilic microbes and is predicted to play a role in 
                     the heat shock response. A <i>yfcA</i> deletion mutant is 
                     more sensitive than wild-type specifically to heat shock, 
                     but not other stresses |CITS: [24580753]|.
                     In the Transporter Classification Database |CITS: 
                     [26546518]| YfcA is an uncharacterized member of the 
                     4-Toluene Sulfonate Uptake Permease (TSUP) family."
