                     /product="DUF2544 domain-containing protein YfcO"
                     /label=yfcO
                     /note="YfcO is a hypothetical protein. Sequence similarity 
                     suggests that it is a member of the Outer Membrane Factor 
                     (OMF) family |CITS: [12192075]|. <i>yfcO</i> is part of a 
                     putative chaperone-usher fimbrial operon |CITS: 
                     [20345943]|.
                     <i>E. coli</i> K-12 contains 12 chaperone-usher fimbrial 
                     operons, including <i>yfcOPQRSTUV</i>; a fimbria-lacking 
                     mutant - strain WQM026 - created by deleting all 12 operons
                     has been characterised |CITS: [33863704]|."
                     /translation="MKILRWLFALVMLIATTEAMAAGHSVDVYYGYNGDSRNIATFNLK
                     IMMPSAVYVGEYKSSQWLMTGEILQNVSWSGPPPAPSVKLIGYHQNINKASCPGLPSGW
