                     /product="CPS-53 (KpLE1) prophage; toxic protein YodE"
                     /label=yodE
                     /note="YodE was identified as a previously unannotated
                     small protein; it is expressed in both exponential and 
                     stationary phase in rich media |CITS: [30837344]|.
                     YodE is encoded within the previously identified small RNA 
                     RyeG; overexpression of YodE leads to an extended lag time 
                     |CITS: [32813020]|.
                     The RyeG RNA co-sediments with the ribosome.  <i>ryeG</i> 
                     is expressed at a low level (3-5 copies per cell) during 
                     growth in rich medium; expression decreases in late 
                     stationary phase |CITS: [32813020]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [32385980]|"
