                     /label=yfdQ
                     /note="The genomic region comprising <i>yfdQRST</i> was
                     found to act as a multicopy suppressor of the <i>hda-185 
                     &Delta;sfiA</i> mutation.  A &Delta;<i>yfdQRST</i> deletion
                     mutant has no obvious growth defect |CITS: [26973617]|.
