                     /EC_number="3.1.3.89"
                     /label=yfdR
                     /note="YfdR is a deoxyribonucleoside 5'-monophosphate 
                     phosphatase with a conserved HD domain.  The enzyme has a 
                     broader substrate range than YfbR |CITS: [18353368]|.
                     YfdR was found to interact with DnaA |CITS: [26973617]|. 
                     The genomic region comprising <i>yfdQRST</i> was found to 
                     act as a multicopy suppressor of the <i>hda-185 
                     &Delta;sfiA</i> mutation.  A &Delta;<i>yfdQRST</i> deletion
                     mutant has no obvious growth defect |CITS: [26973617]|."
