                     /product="protein YfdX"
                     /label=yfdX
                     /note="Expression of YfdX is induced by overexpression of
                     the EvgA response regulator of the EvgAS two-component 
                     signal transduction system |CITS: [11157960]|.  Expression 
                     of <i>yfdX</i> increases at the onset of stationary phase 
                     |CITS: [16885321]|.
                     Deletion of <i>yfdXWUVE</i> slightly decreases acid 
                     resistance |CITS: [12399493]|."
                     /translation="MKRLIMATMVTAILASSTVWAADNAPVAAQQQTQQVQQTQKTAAA
