     gene            2512292..2512684
                     /gene="yfeD"
                     /locus_tag="b2399"
                     /label=yfeD
     CDS             2512292..2512684
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfeD"
                     /locus_tag="b2399"
                     /product="putative DNA-binding transcriptional regulator
                     YfeD"
                     /label=yfeD
                     /note="The <i>yfeCD</i> locus was predicted to encode a 
                     toxin/antitoxin pair |CITS: [17678530]|.  However, no 
                     evidence for this function was found |CITS: [19943910]|. 
                     YfeD appears to belong to the LysR family of transcription 
                     factors, and it was predicted to regulate genes related to 
                     DNA replication and Ni/Co uptake |CITS: [35880217]|. 
                     Genome-wide YfeD binding sites were determined <i>in 
                     vivo</i> by the chromatin immunoprecipitation method 
                     combined with lambda exonuclease digestion (ChIP-exo) in 
                     glucose M9 minimal medium |CITS: [34428301]|.
                     The transcription of the <i>yfeD</i> gene is affected by 
                     temperature, oxidative stress, and glucose-lactose shift 
                     |CITS: [35880217]|."
