                     /locus_tag="b2410"
                     /product="putative solute:Na(+) symporter"
                     /label=yfeH
                     /note="A <I>yfeH</I> in-frame deletion mutant 
                     (&Delta;<i>yfeH::kan</i>) has strongly repressed swarming 
                     motility, but swimming is unchanged |CITS:[17122336]|. 
                     Expression of <I>yfeH</I> is induced 3-fold in response to 
                     the AI-2 quorum signal |CITS:[11514505]|.
                     In the Transporter Classification Database, YfeH is an 
                     uncharacterized member of the Bile Acid:Na<sup>+</sup> 
                     Symporter (BASS) family within the Bile/Arsenite/Riboflvain
                     Transporter (BART) superfamily |CITS: [26546518]|"
