                     resembles the HycB subunit of hydrogenase 3 (50% sequence 
                     identity); the protein is predicted to contain four 
                     [4Fe-4S] clusters and may function as an electron 
                     transferring subunit |CITS: [9387241]|. HyfA may contain 
                     some &beta;-structure elements |CITS: [12192075]|"
