                     /product="putative hydrogenase 4 assembly protein"
                     /label=hyfJ
                     /note="The hyfJ gene is part of the hyf operon, and
                     expression of adjacent genes may be translationally coupled
                     |CITS: [12426353]|. HyfJ shares 45% overall amino acid 
                     sequence identity with |FRAME: EG10481-MONOMER ""HycH""| 
                     and the two proteins may share overlapping functions |CITS:
                     [9387241][28718449]|."
