     CDS             complement(2608179..2609240)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfgO"
                     /locus_tag="b2493"
                     /product="putative transporter YfgO"
                     /label=yfgO
                     /note="The C-terminal part of this gene downstream of the 
                     |FRAME: TU686| operon was sequenced in a study of the hyf 
                     operon and found to be 75% identical to a putative permease
                     in <i>Haemophilus influenzae</i> |CITS: [9387241]|.
                     In the Transporter Classification Database <i>E. coli</i> 
                     YfgO is called PerM and is a member of the Autoinducer-2 
                     Exporter (AI-2E) Family (2.A.86) (previously called the 
                     PerM family) |CITS: [24225317][20559013]| (see also |CITS: 
                     [ 32457721]|)."
                     /translation="MLEMLMQWYRRRFSDPEAIALLVILVAGFGIIFFFSGLLAPLLVA
