     CDS             2623151..2623669
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yfgH"
                     /locus_tag="b2505"
                     /product="lipoprotein YfgH"
                     /label=yfgH
                     /note="Strong aggravating interactions (measured by
                     relative colony size and fitness in rich medium) were 
                     observed between <i>lptD</i> and <i>yfgH</i> |CITS: 
                     [22125496]|. Deletion of <i>yfgH</i> results in impaired 
                     outer membrane integrity as evidenced by vancomycin induced
                     morphological defects and lowered outer membrane protein 
                     (OMP) abundance |CITS: [22125496]|. Deletion of <i>yfgH</i>
                     and <i>lptD</i> results in cell wall failure/lysis, lowered
                     OMP abundance and increased levels of the DegP stress 
                     response protease |CITS: [22125496]|. YfgH contains a 
                     predicted lipoprotein signal; YfgH is an experimentally 
                     confirmed lipoprotein (|CITS: [12876315], [15174130]| based
                     on unpublished results)."
