                     /product="protein SseB"
                     /label=sseB
                     /note="Overexpression of <i>sseA</i> or <i>sseB</i>
                     enhances the serine sensitivity caused by serine-mediated 
                     inhibition of |FRAME: ASPKINIHOMOSERDEHYDROGI-MONOMER 
                     homoserine dehydrogenase I| activity during growth on some 
                     carbon sources |CITS: [7982894]|.  A transposon insertion 
                     mutation in <i>sseB</i> causes increased fimbrial 
                     production in an <i>E. coli</i> strain that exhibits K88 
                     fimbriae |CITS: [8722098]|.
                     SseB: ""<b>s</b>erine <b>s</b>ensitivity <b>e</b>nhancing 
                     <b>B</b>"" |CITS: [7982894]|"
