                     /product="putative aldose 1-epimerase YphB"
                     /label=yphB
                     /note="YphB may be a sulfoquinovose mutarotase.  The gene 
                     cluster encoding enzymes of the sulfoquinovose degradation 
                     pathway is conserved, and a putative epimerase is encoded 
                     by |FRAME: EG11844-MONOMER YihR| within the gene cluser. 
                     The YihR homolog of <i>Herbaspirillum seropedicaea</i> was 
                     shown to have sulfoquinovose mutarotase activity |CITS: 
                     [29535276]|.  However, the best BLAST hit of the <i>H. 
                     seropedicaea</i> protein in the <i>E. coli</i> genome is 
                     YphB rather than YihR."
