                     /product="bifunctional putative ABC transporter membrane
                     subunit YphD / putative transport complex, ABC superfamily"
                     /label=yphD
                     /note="YphD is predicted to be the membrane subunit of a 
                     putative ATP-dependent transporter |CITS: 
                     [18634750][26546518]|. YphD is predicted to be an inner 
                     membrane protein with 9 transmembrane domains |CITS: 
                     [15919996]|. YphD is implicated in maintaining antibiotic 
                     tolerance under starvation; <i>yphD</i> is upregulated 
                     during nutrient starvation and the starvation-induced 
                     ampicillin tolerance levels of a <i>yphD</i> knockout 
                     strain are significantly reduced over both a 6 and 30 day 
                     period |CITS: [34787438]|."
