                     /note="OhsC was first identified in a cloning-based screen
                     for small RNAs |CITS: [15718303]|. OhsC negatively 
                     regulates the expression of the |FRAME: MONOMER0-2860| 
                     |CITS: [18710431]|.
                     OhsC is most highly expressed under stationary phase 
                     conditions in minimal medium |CITS: [15718303]|.
                     Ryx: ""RNA of unknown function at X position (10 minute) in
                     the genome"" |CITS: [11445539]|
                     OhsC: ""<b>o</b>ppression of <b>h</b>ydrophobic ORF by 
