                     /product="rpoE leader peptide"
                     /label=rseD
                     /note="Translation of <i>rpoE</i>, which encodes the 
                     extracytoplasmic stress response sigma factor 
                     &sigma;<sup>E</sup>, is coupled to the translation of the 
                     <i>rpoE</i> leader peptide, RseD.  If translational 
                     coupling is eliminated, translation of <i>rpoE</i> is 
                     reduced by more than 50% |CITS: [28924029]|."
