                     /note="YfiF appears to affect the initiation of DNA
                     replication by influencing the content of DnaA per cell 
                     |CITS: [34486756]|.
                     YfiF physically interacts with |FRAME: G7950-MONOMER|. 
                     Potential functional domains of YfiF were investigated by 
                     site-directed mutagenesis |CITS: [34486756]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>yfiF</i> mutant shows an increased doubling 
                     time and delayed initiation of replication; overexpression 
                     of <i>yfiF</i> leads to early initiation of replication 
                     |CITS: [34486756]|."
