     rRNA            complement(2719428..2719547)
                     /gene="rrfG"
                     /locus_tag="b2588"
                     /product="5S ribosomal RNA"
                     /label=rrfG
                     /note="The 5S and 23S rRNAs are the RNA components of the
                     large subunit (50S subunit) of the <i>E. coli</i> ribosome.
                     There are seven ribosomal RNA (rRNA) operons, called rrnA, 
                     rrnB, rrnC,
                     rrnD, rrnE, rrnG, and rrnH |CITS: [COLISALII]|.  Each 
                     operon contains a
                     16S rRNA gene, a 23S rRNA gene, and a 5S rRNA gene (except 
                     the rrnD
                     operon, which contains two 5S rRNA genes) interspersed with
                     various tRNA
                     genes |CITS: [COLISALII]|.  Regarding nomenclature, ""rrs""
                     genes encode 16S
                     rRNAs, ""rrl"" genes encode 23S rRNAs, and ""rrf"" genes 
                     encode 5S rRNAs
                     |CITS: [COLISALII]|.
                     The sequence and structure of the 5S rRNA has been 
                     described |CITS: [4862513], [4865115], [4890842], 
                     [4868898], [4868442], [4872142], [4880610], [4895025], 
                     [4899461], [4904262], [4948666], [4556238], [808733], 
                     [318664], [333392], [409850], [337236], [334253], [359039],
                     [368804], [724507], [369943], [116192], [388350], 
                     [6157056], [6158045], [6158943], [6162474], [7034426], 
                     [7015289], [6170933], [7038676], [6274397], [6278442], 
                     [7041089], [6807343], [6181508], [6182528], [6759922], 
                     [6818528], [7155895], [6295470], [6346054], [6347249], 
                     [6347250], [6344007], [6401116], [6400893], [6366745], 
                     [6201825], [6380589], [6207022], [2581611], [3917034], 
                     [3525135], [2427108], [3535886], [2429262], [3542026], 
                     [2434327], [2444255], [2468977], [2752012], [2669961], 
                     [2677996], [2561346], [1695848], [1863690], [1705555], 
                     [1717695], [1371071], [1541273], [1541274], [7515624], 
                     [8722004], [8603119], [8641454], [8692701], [9393863], 
                     [9438864], [9740131], [9740132], [10454606], [10562563], 
                     [10696113], [10780406], [12903337]|.
                     The relationship of the 5S rRNA to ribosome assembly, 
                     structure, and function has been characterized |CITS: 
                     [4968699], [4874775], [4980101], [4908845], [4941838], 
                     [4350484], [4553099], [4584885], [773691], [781671], 
                     [370785], [109811], [6157056], [6158045], [6162473], 
                     [6169004], [7029538], [6798570], [6174405], [7038683], 
                     [6181508], [6338479], [6340064], [6340734], [6349628], 
                     [6354252], [7514294], [9592132], [9740132], [9813114], 
                     [10325415], [10756104], [10860746]|.
                     Interactions between the 5S rRNA and ribosomal proteins 
                     have been described |CITS: [4567807], [4578553], [1096086],
                     [1098937], [1100506], [1107816], [776368], [776688], 
                     [333392], [353489], [353728], [354687], [365228], [379819],
                     [393829], [6159586], [7015289], [7019670], [7038676], 
                     [6278442], [6178424], [6347250], [6401116], [6364140], 
                     [6372859], [2990903], [3892485], [3535886], [3060848], 
                     [2472486], [1693861], [1702198], [8603119], [8925931], 
                     [10562563], [10696113], [11094158], [12515387]|.
                     Interactions between the 5S rRNA and 23S rRNA have been 
                     described |CITS: [4568456], [1095416], [6159586], 
                     [9813114]|.
                     Analysis of mutations in 5S rRNA has been conducted |CITS: 
                     [6798570], [6091046], [2429677], [3314994], [3071690], 
                     [3060848], [2479908], [9468316], [9862991], [11391469]|. 
                     The post-transcriptional processing of the 5S rRNA has been
                     characterized |CITS: [4981108], [4902681], [4931952], 
                     [329997], [365352], [372546], [6163761], [6199344], 
                     [6380579], [3045757], [1713283], [1644765], [1474579], 
                     [8415644], [7510217], [7542780], [9501232], [10926508], 
                     [11952897], [12050169]|.
                     Regulation has been described in detail; for a review see 
                     |CITS: [12732305]|.
                     Reviews |CITS: [152015], [94160], [3913708], [3071658], 
                     [3071660], [3071690], [3071691], [1764510], [8603119], 
                     [9572078]|.
                     "
