                     /product="multifunctional glycine betaine ABC transporter 
                     periplasmic binding protein ProX / glycine betaine ABC 
                     transporter / transport of a quarternary amine / transport 
                     of proline"
                     /EC_number="7.6.2.9"
                     /label=proX
                     /note="ProX is the periplasmic binding protein of an 
                     osmoresponsive ABC transport system that imports compounds 
                     such as glycine betaine and proline betaine in response to 
                     osmotic upshift.
                     Purified ProX consists of two globular domains connected 
                     through a hinge region; a ligand binding site is located in
                     a cleft between the two domains and three tryptophan 
                     residues are directly implicated in binding quaternary 
                     ammonium groups |CITS:[14612446]|."
