     CDS             join(2801675..2801935,2801929..2802852)
                     /pseudo
                     /gene="ygaY"
                     /locus_tag="b2681"
                     /product="putative transporter YgaY, N-terminal fragment"
                     /label=ygaY
                     /note="<i>ygaX</i> and <i>ygaY</i> probably represent two 
                     fragments of a pseudogene in <i>E. coli</i> K-12; a 
                     full-length gene (encoding a 394 residue protein) is 
                     present in <i>E. coli</i> O157 |CITS: [12234664]| and 
                     encodes an uncharacterized permease of the major 
                     facilitator superfamily (MFS) of transporters |CITS: 
                     [9529885][26546518]|.
                     In <i>E. coli</i> K-12 MC4100, <i>ygaY_2</i> is induced 
                     after osmotic upshift |CITS: [12218039]|.
                     "
