                     L-valine exporter"
                     /label=ygaZ
                     /note="YgaZ is one protein of a putative two-component 
                     transporter that is implicated in L-valine export in <i>E. 
                     coli</i> K-12.
                     YgaZ has 27% identity to the BrnF protein of the 
                     <i>Corynebacterium glutamicum</i> methionine/branched chain
                     amino acid export system |CITS: [17463081]|.
                     The expression of <i>ygaZ</i> is significantly induced when
                     cells are cultured on mouse cecal mucus compared to cells 
                     grown on glucose |CITS: [15123798]|."
