                     /product="bifunctional fructose-1-phosphate phosphatase
                     YqaB / fructose-1-phosphatase"
                     /label=yqaB
                     /note="YqaB is a sugar phosphatase belonging to the
                     superfamily of haloacid dehalogenase (HAD)-like hydrolases.
                      In addition to its main fructose-1-phosphatase activity, 
                     YqaB has low &beta;-phosphoglucomutase activity |CITS: 
                     [16990279]|.
                     The phosphatase activity of YqaB was first discovered in a 
                     high-throughput screen of purified proteins |CITS: 
                     [15808744]|.
                     No measurable sorbitol-6-phosphate phosphatase activity was
                     detected |CITS: [29743459]|."
