                     soluble protein. SrlB may possess a net negative charge at 
                     neutral pH as predicted from it's amino acid sequence 
                     |CITS: [3553176]|.
                     <i>srlB</i>, among other genes involved in carbon source 
                     transport and metabolism, was downregulated in two MG1655 
                     lysogens carrying closely related Stx2a phages O104 and PA8
                     |CITS: 31208335|."
