                     /note="ArcA appears to activate <i>hycD</i> expression
                     under anaerobiosis; a putative ArcA binding site was 
                     identified 55 bp upstream of this gene |CITS: [15699038]|, 
                     but no promoter upstream of it has been identified. Instead
                     <i>hycD</i> is transcribed from a promoter that is located 
                     usptream of <i>hycA</i> gene."
