                     /label=ygbN
                     /note="YgbN is an uncharacterized member of the
                     Gluconate:H+ Symporter (GntP) family of transporters |CITS:
                     [9119199][24225317]|. Expression of <i>ygbN</i> from a 
                     plasmid does not confer gluconate transport in a gluconate 
                     transport deficient host |CITS: [9119199]|."
