     gene            complement(2873147..2873746)
                     /gene="casE"
                     /locus_tag="b2756"
                     /label=casE
     CDS             complement(2873147..2873746)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="casE"
                     /locus_tag="b2756"
                     /product="trifunctional pre-CRISPR RNA endonuclease / 
                     CRISPR-associated complex for antiviral defense / CRISPR 
                     RNA processing"
                     /label=casE
                     /note="CasE is the only Cascade subunit that is necessary
                     and sufficient for cleavage of pre-CRISPR RNA to generate 
                     the mature crRNA. The cleavage reaction is highly specific 
                     for the endogenous pre-crRNA, occurring 8 nt upstream of 
                     the spacer region |CITS: [18703739]|.
                     CasE binds the 3' end of pre-crRNA. CasE connects to the 
                     Cascade complex through contacts with CasC (Cas7.1) and 
                     CasB (Cas2.1). CasE contains tandem RNA recognition motifs 
                     (RRMs) connected by the 8 nt residue linker. The RRMs form 
                     a cleft on one face of the protein that binds a short helix
                     from the first CasC subunit. The opposite face of the 
                     protein contacts the pre-crRNA and positions it for 
                     cleavage. After cleavage, the mature crRNA remains 
                     associated with CasE |CITS: [25103409]|.
                     A mutation in the conserved H20 residue of CasE leads to 
                     loss of pre-crRNA cleavage |CITS: [18703739]|. If mature 
                     crRNA is generated from engineered transcription units, 
                     CasE is not required for CRISPR interference and primed 
                     adaptation |CITS: [26013814]|.
                     CasE: ""<b>C</b>RISPR-<b>as</b>sociated"" |CITS: 
                     [18703739]|"
