     gene            complement(2874410..2875501)
                     /gene="casC"
                     /locus_tag="b2758"
                     /label=casC
     CDS             complement(2874410..2875501)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="casC"
                     /locus_tag="b2758"
                     /product="trifunctional type I-E CRISPR system Cascade
                     subunit CasC / CRISPR-associated complex for antiviral 
                     defense / CRISPR RNA processing"
                     /label=casC
                     /note="The 6 CasC (Cas7.1 - Cas7.6) subunits of the
                     Cascade complex form a helical structure that binds crRNA 
                     and presents it for target DNA binding. Bound crRNA 
                     presents as 6 segments with a kink occurring at every 6th 
                     ribonucleotide. Mutating the target DNA residues that are 
                     complementary to the 'kink' residues does not affect target
                     binding whereas mutating target residues located either 
                     side of the kink residues results in serious defects in 
                     target binding  |CITS: [25103409]|. The CasC subunits 
                     interact with the CasB head-to-tail dimer in the Cascade 
                     complex; Cas7.1 interacts with CasE |CITS: [25103409]|. 
                     CasC interacts with the crRNA-target DNA hybrid |CITS: 
                     [25123481]|
                     The structure of CasC is described as a 'hand', consisting 
                     of 'fingers' (residues 59-180), palm (residues 1-58, 
                     181-189 and 224-263) and 'thumb' (residues 190-223). The 
                     thumb of CasC prohibits base-pairing at the kink sites of 
                     the crRNA-target DNA hybrid |CITS: [25123481]|.  A 
                     lysine-rich helix in CasC makes non-specific contacts with 
                     the phosphate backbone of the dsDNA target that are 
                     required for dsDNA binding of Cascade |CITS: [26243775]|. 
                     CasC: ""<b>C</b>RISPR-<b>as</b>sociated"" |CITS: 
                     [18703739]|"
