     CDS             complement(2977770..2978951)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yqeF"
                     /locus_tag="b2844"
                     /product="putative acyltransferase"
                     /label=yqeF
                     /note="<I>yqeF</I> encodes a predicted acetyl-CoA 
                     acetyltransferase |CITS: [16397293]|.  Expression of YqeF 
                     together with FucO enables engineered reversal of the fatty
                     acid &beta;-oxidation cycle for production of butanol 
                     |CITS: [21832992]|.
                     <i>yqeF</i> is induced during a second phase of growth on 
                     mucus when genes for anaerobic respiration, ethanolamine 
                     and fucose degradation, and the TCA cycle are induced 
                     |CITS: [15123798]|.  <i>yqeF</i> was shown to be 
                     upregulated in glucose-limited chemostat cultures |CITS: 
                     [15066832]|.  Mutation of the three PhoB binding sites in 
                     the <i>yqeF-yqeG</i> intergenic region resulted in 
                     five-fold decreased expression of <i>yqeF</i> |CITS: 
                     [14762058]|.
                     "
