                     /product="putative transporter YqeG"
                     /label=yqeG
                     /note="The YqeG protein is an uncharacterised member of
                     the Hydroxy/Aromatic Amino Acid Permease (HAAAP) Family of 
                     transporters |CITS: [24225317]|.
                     <i>yqeG</i> is induced by <i>E. coli</i> stationary-phase 
                     supernatant perhaps due to quorum-sensing signals |CITS: 
                     [15066794]|.  Mutation of the three PhoB binding sites in 
                     the <i>yqeF-yqeG</i> intergenic region results in increased
                     expression of <i>yqeG</i> |CITS: [14762058]|."
