                     /EC_number="5.4.99.2"
                     /label=scpA
                     /note="Methylmalonyl-CoA mutase (MCM) catalyzes the
                     reversible, stereospecific interconversion of 
                     methylmalonyl-CoA to succinyl-CoA |CITS: 
                     [10769117][11955068]|.  The enzyme may participate in a 
                     pathway of succinate
                     decarboxylation whose metabolic role is unknown |CITS: 
                     [10769117]|.
                     MCM and the YgfD (ArgK) protein interact both <i>in 
                     vivo</i> and <i>in vitro</i> |CITS: [18950999]|.
                     Sbm: ""<b>s</b>leeping <b>b</b>eauty <b>m</b>utase"" |CITS:
                     [1355087]|"
