                     /product="trifunctional mannitol-specific PTS enzyme IICB
                     component CmtA / mannitol-specific PTS enzyme II CmtBA / 
                     D-mannitol transport"
                     /EC_number="2.7.1.197"
                     /label=cmtA
                     /note="CmtA has 52% amino acid identity with the EIICB
                     domain of MltA, the mannitol PTS permease. <i>cmtA</i> may 
                     encode a protein with 6 transmembrane regions; a conserved 
                     cysteine residue at position 377 may be required for 
                     phosphoryl transfer to substrate. Expression of <i>cmtA</i>
                     under the control of heterologous promoter led to mannitol 
                     transport in <i>mtlA</i> mutants of <i>E. coli</i> K-12  
                     |CITS: [8353127]|."
