                     /product="trifunctional mannitol-specific PTS enzyme IIA
                     component CmtB / mannitol-specific PTS enzyme II CmtBA / 
                     D-mannitol transport"
                     /EC_number="2.7.1.197"
                     /label=cmtB
                     /note="<i>cmtB</i> encodes a hydrophilic protein with
                     seqence similarity to the EIIA domain of MltA, the mannitol
                     PTS permease |CITS: [8353127]|. Expression of <i>cmtB</i> 
                     from a <i>lac</i> promoter partially complements the growth
                     defect of an <i>E. coli mtlA</i> C-terminal deletion mutant
                     |CITS: [8353127]|. A solution structure of CmtB shows high 
                     similarity with that of the MltA IIA domain although 
                     structural differences around the active site are present. 
                     Histidine residue 67 is predicted to be the site of 
                     phosphorylation |CITS: [17803963]|."
