                     /EC_number="1.1.99.14"
                     /label=glcF
                     /note="GlcF is similar to iron-sulfur proteins and could
                     only be detected as a membrane-associated protein |CITS: 
                     [8606183]|.
                     A <i>glcF</i> insertion mutant lacks glycolate 
                     dehydrogenase activity |CITS: [8606183]|.  <i>glcF</i> 
                     expression is increased in a mutant with enhanced butanol 
                     tolerance; overexpression of <i>glcF</i> in an otherwise 
                     wild-type background improves growth in the presence of 
                     butanol slightly |CITS: [27252779]|.
                     GlcF: ""<b>gl</b>y<b>c</b>olate utilization <b>F</b>"" 
                     |CITS: [7925370][8606183]|"
