                     /gene="yghO"
                     /locus_tag="b2981"
                     /product="putative DNA-binding transcriptional regulator
                     YghO"
                     /label=yghO
                     /note="Transcription of <i>yghO</i> is induced upon
                     biofilm formation compared to planktonic growth in 
                     exponential phase.  Induction of expression was found to be
                     dependent on the presence of the F plasmid |CITS: 
                     [14731270]|.
                     A <i>yghO</i> mutant is impaired in biofilm formation 
                     |CITS: [14731270]|.
                     YghO was transcriptionally upregulated in iron excess over 
                     iron limitation at 21% and 63% of dissolved oxygen as 
                     determined by RNA-seq |CITS:[ 35777694]|."
