                     <i>Buchnera aphidicola</i>, an endosymbiont of aphids 
                     |CITS: [9244264]|.
                     Overexpression of <i>yqhA</i> from an ASKA plasmid leads to
                     a more than 3-fold increase in the MIC of hydrogen peroxide
                     |CITS: [34072091]|."
