     gene            complement(3162108..3162590)
                     /gene="ygiV"
                     /locus_tag="b3023"
                     /label=ygiV
     CDS             complement(3162108..3162590)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ygiV"
                     /locus_tag="b3023"
                     /product="DNA-binding transcriptional repressor YgiV"
                     /label=ygiV
                     /note="YgiV had been predicted as a transcriptional
                     regulator |CITS:[9278503][19376874]|. However, based on 
                     nickel enrichment DNA microarrays and additional gel shift 
                     assays, it was identified as a transcriptional repressor of
                     <i>mcbR</i>, which regulates biofilm formation and 
                     mucoidity by repressing expression of <i>mcbA</i> 
                     (<i>ybiM</i>) |CITS: [18309357]|. In the <i>E. coli</i> 
                     K-12-derived strain BW25113, a <i>ygiV</i> knockout mutant,
                     only a slightly increase in biofilm formation was observed,
                     in contrast to the large decrease observed with the same 
                     mutation in the pathogenic strain UPEC CFT073 |CITS: 
                     [35025506]|.
                     MqsR has a toxic effect on <i>Escherichia coli</i> 
                     bacterial growth, which is partially reduced by the 
                     <i>ygiV</i> mutation |CITS: [18309357]|.
                     Inhibition of <i>ygiV</i> expression by CRISPRi reduced 
                     cellular fitness under treatment with the antibiotics 
                     pyocyanin or novobiocin |CITS:[40352728]|."
                     /translation="MTNLTLDVNIIDFPSIPVAMLPHRCSPELLNYSVAKFIMWRKETG
                     LSPVNQSQTFGVAWDDPATTAPEAFRFDICGSVSEPIPDNRYGVSNGELTGGRYAVARH
                     VGELDDISHTVWGIIRHWLPASGEKMRKAPILFHYTNLAEGVTEQRLETDVYVPLA"
                     /go_component="cytosol [goid 0005829] [evidence IEA] [PMID
                     19054114]"
                     /go_process="negative regulation of DNA-templated
                     transcription [goid 0045892] [evidence IBA] [GO_REF 
