                     /product="esterase YqiA"
                     /label=yqiA
                     /note="Esterase activity of YqiA was discovered in a 
                     high-throughput screen of purified proteins |CITS: 
                     [15808744]|.
                     <i>yqiA</i> insertion mutants were identified in a genetic 
                     screen for genes that are important for survival of 
                     exposure to ionizing radiation (IR).  The authors were 
                     unable to generate a <i>yqiA</i> deletion mutant |CITS: 
                     [25049088]|; however, a <i>yqiA</i> deletion mutant in the 
                     BW25113 strain background is part of the Keio collection 
                     |CITS: [16738554]|.
                     "
