                     similarity to the open reading frames encoded on the 
                     opposite strand of the <i>sib</i> small RNAs |CITS: 
                     [18710431]|.
                     Overexpression of IbsE is toxic to the cell |CITS: 
                     [18710431]|.
                     IbsE is predicted to be a bitopic inner membrane protein 
                     |CITS: [27510400]|
                     IbsE: ""<b>i</b>nduction <b>b</b>rings <b>s</b>tasis"" 
                     |CITS: [18710431]|"
                     /translation="MMKLVIILVVLLLLSFPTY"
                     /go_component="plasma membrane [goid 0005886] [evidence
