     gene            3199822..3200733
                     /gene="ttdA"
                     /locus_tag="b3061"
                     /label=ttdA
     CDS             3199822..3200733
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="ttdA"
                     /locus_tag="b3061"
                     /product="bifunctional L(+)-tartrate dehydratase subunit
                     alpha / L(+)-tartrate dehydratase"
                     /EC_number="4.2.1.32"
                     /label=ttdA
                     /note="The <i>ttdA</i> gene encodes the &alpha; subunit of 
                     L-tartrate dehydratase |CITS: [8371115]|.
                     Transcription of <i>ttdA</i> is activated by the LysR-type 
                     transcriptional activator TtdR in the presence of 
                     L-tartrate or <i>meso</i>-tartrate and is repressed by 
                     O<sub>2</sub> and nitrate.  Binding of TtdR to the 
                     <i>ttdA-ttdR</i> intergenic region has been shown |CITS: 
                     [19661178]|.  Anaerobic induction depends on FNR |CITS: 
                     [19661178]|.
                     TtdA appears to be involved in biofilm formation.  A 
                     &Delta;<i>ttdA</i> mutant shows a significant decrease in 
                     biofilm formation.  Deletion of <i>tqsA</i> increases 
                     biofilm formation and increases expression of <i>ttdA</i> 
                     11-fold |CITS: [16385049]|.
                     TtdA: ""L-<b>t</b>ar<b>t</b>rate <b>d</b>ehydratase 
                     <b>A</b>"" |CITS: [8371115]|"
