     CDS             3204140..3204355
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="rpsU"
                     /locus_tag="b3065"
                     /product="trifunctional 30S ribosomal subunit protein S21
                     / 30S ribosomal subunit / ribosome"
                     /label=rpsU
                     /note="The S21 protein is a component of the 30S subunit
                     of the ribosome.  S21 was found to associate with the 50S 
                     subunit
                     of the ribosome as well as the 30S subunit |CITS: 
                     [6388639]|.
                     Interactions between S21 and 16S rRNA have been mapped 
                     |CITS: [2459389]|.  S21 also crosslinks to the 4.5S RNA
                     of the signal recognition particle |CITS: [16043501]|. 
                     Interactions between S21 and mRNA can be shown by 
                     fluorescence energy transfer |CITS: [2029524]| and 
                     crosslinking |CITS: [1397315]|.
                     S21 is required for full activity of translation initiation
                     |CITS: [4595779][7028483]|.  S21 was also shown to 
                     crosslink to
                     IF3 |CITS: [7000779][7020604]|.
                     Processing and degradation of the <i>rpsU-dnaG-rpoD</i> 
                     operon mRNA has been studied; see for example
                     |CITS: [7685758][6388849]| and references therein.
                     Review: |CITS: [6388849]|
                     "
