                     /gene="yqjC"
                     /locus_tag="b3097"
                     /product="DUF1090 domain-containing protein YqjC"
                     /label=yqjC
                     /note="Expression of <i>yqjC</i> is reduced in an RpoS
                     K173E mutant compared to wild type |CITS: [22438941]|.
                     A top-down proteomics study for <i>E. coli</i> found this 
                     |FRAME: G7611| to have a high number of proteoforms, 
                     including one showing a cysteine residue that has 
                     carbamidomethylation modification and one showing a signal 
                     peptide cleavage |CITS: [30972727]|."
                     /translation="MKYRIALAVSLFALSAGSYATTLCQEKEQNILKEISYAEKHQNQN
                     RIDGLNKALSEVRANCSDSQLRADHQKKIAKQKDEVAERQQDLAEAKQKGDADKIAKRE
