                     /label=prlF
                     /note="PrlF is the antitoxin component in the PrlF-YhaV 
                     antitoxin-toxin complex.
                     Overproduction of PrlF yields a growth defect and increased
                     export of a reporter protein |CITS: [2152898]|. <i>prlF</i>
                     mutants show activated |FRAME: CPLX0-2881| activity, and 
                     suppression of heat sensitivity in <i>htrA</i> mutants 
                     |CITS: [1512198][2407727]|. <i>prlF htrA</i> double mutants
                     are cold sensitive |CITS: [2407727]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [22060041][31932311]|"
