                     L21 interacts with 23S rRNA |CITS: [9693099][6170035]|. L4,
                     L5, and L21 bind to erythromycin cooperatively |CITS: 
                     [2256953]|.
                     The <i>rplU</i> gene is expressed from an operon along with
                     <i>rpmA</i>, <i>yhbE</i>, and <i>obgE</i> under control of 
                     the <i>rplU</i> promoter. This operon is mainly expressed 
                     during exponential growth and is probably indirectly 
                     regulated by ppGpp/DksA |CITS:[ 27137500]|."
