                     /product="protein kinase-like domain-containing protein
                     YrbL"
                     /label=yrbL
                     /note="Transcription of <i>yrbL</i> is regulated by 
                     Mg<sup>2+</sup> via the PhoP/PhoQ system |CITS: 
                     [12813061]|. A mutant with a constitutively active 
                     EvgA/EvgS two-component system shows enhanced expression of
                     <i>yrbL</i> |CITS: [15126461]|.
                     |FRAME: APORNAP-CPLX| pausing during elongation at 
                     consensus sequence elements has been studied using 
                     <i>yrbL</i> |CITS: [24926020][38990947]|."
