                     /note="Purified YhcC can be reconstituted to contain a
                     4Fe-4S cluster.  In support of its annotation as a radical 
                     SAM enzyme, the Fe-S cluster-containing enzyme catalyzes 
                     the reductive cleavage of <i>S</i>-adenosylmethionine to 
                     methionine and 5'-deoxyadenosine |CITS: [25117543]|. 
                     Review: |CITS: [35349713]|"
