     gene            complement(3383942..3385387)
                     /gene="tldD"
                     /locus_tag="b3244"
                     /label=tldD
     CDS             complement(3383942..3385387)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="tldD"
                     /locus_tag="b3244"
                     /product="trifunctional metalloprotease subunit TldD / 
                     metalloprotease TldDE / microcin B17 precursor protease"
                     /label=tldD
                     /note="TldD and TldE form a stable heterodimeric complex
                     with protease activity.  TldD contains a 
                     metalloprotease-like HExxxH motif; the two His residues 
                     were shown to coordinate a metal ion in the crystal 
                     structure.  A His262Ala mutant in the HExxxH motif lacks 
                     activity |CITS: [28943336]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>tldD</i> mutant harboring the pMccB17 plasmid 
                     accumulates the unprocessed Microcin B17 precursor protein,
                     in contrast to wild type, which processes and exports 
                     Microcin B17 from the cell |CITS: [12029038]|.  A 
                     <i>tldD</i> mutant exhibits resistance to the F 
                     plasmid-encoded LetD DNA gyrase inhibitor |CITS: 
                     [8604133]|, but only in the presence of the LetD inhibitor 
                     LetA |CITS: [12029038]|.  A <i>csrA</i> mutation suppresses
                     the Tld phenotype of a <i>tldD</i> mutant |CITS: 
                     [8604133]|.
                     TldD: ""<b>t</b>olerant for <i><b>l</b>et<b>D</b></i> 
                     expression <b>D</b>"" |CITS: [8604133]|
                     Reviews: |CITS: [36155963]|"
