     CDS             3407223..3408380
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="acrE"
                     /locus_tag="b3265"
                     /product="bifunctional multidrug efflux pump membrane
                     fusion lipoprotein AcrE / multidrug efflux pump AcrEF-TolC"
                     /label=acrE
                     /note="AcrE shares 65% amino acid identity with the
                     membrane fusion protein |FRAME: EG11703-MONOMER ""AcrA""| 
                     of the AcrAB efflux pump complex |CITS: 
                     [1720861][8407802]|. <i>acrEF</i> is not expressed at 
                     significant levels in wild-type K-12 strains (see |CITS: 
                     [7889326][8830678]|) but is expressed at high level upon 
                     integration of IS<i>1</i> or IS<i>2</i> into the upstream 
                     region of the operon |CITS: [11274125]| or upon deletion of
                     the |FRAME: PD00288 ""H-NS repressor protein""| |CITS: 
                     [14973023]|; when expressed AcrE functions in 
                     <i>Escherichia coli</i> as part of a drug efflux system 
                     with the AcrF RND type permease and the TolC outer membrane
                     protein |CITS: [11274125]| (see |FRAME: CPLX0-2141| for 
                     more details).
                     Cloned AcrE is an inner membrane anchored lipoprotein 
                     |CITS: [8472900]|."
