     gene            complement(3443607..3443885)
                     /gene="rpsS"
                     /locus_tag="b3316"
                     /label=rpsS
     CDS             complement(3443607..3443885)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="rpsS"
                     /locus_tag="b3316"
                     /product="trifunctional 30S ribosomal subunit protein S19
                     / 30S ribosomal subunit / ribosome"
                     /label=rpsS
                     /note="The S19 protein is a component of the 30S subunit
                     of the ribosome.
                     S19 interacts with 16S rRNA |CITS: [2438658][3279390]|. S13
                     forms a complex with S19 in order to bind to 16S rRNA at 
                     its specific site |CITS: [324809][3903659][3279034]|. 
                     Binding of S19 to 16S rRNA is necessary and sufficient for 
                     converting 16S rRNA into a substrate for |FRAME: 
                     EG10343-MONOMER|, while it abolishes activity of |FRAME: 
                     EG12163-MONOMER| |CITS: [1766869]|.
                     S19 can be crosslinked to aminoacyl-tRNA at the ribosomal A
                     site |CITS: [6363713][8524654]| and P site
                     |CITS: [8251501]|. S19 was also shown to crosslink to IF3 
                     |CITS: [6349681]|.
                     The ribosome maturation protein RimM binds to S19 in the 
                     30S subunit. An <i>rpsS</i> mutation suppresses the 
                     polysome and 16S rRNA processing deficiencies of a 
                     <i>rimM</i> point mutant, but not a <i>rimM</i> deletion 
                     mutant
                     |CITS: [15496525]|."
