                     /product="bacterioferritin-associated ferredoxin"
                     /label=bfd
                     /note="Bfd is thought to be involved in Bfr iron storage
                     and iron release functions or in regulation of |FRAME: 
                     EG10113-MONOMER| protein Bfr |CITS: [8639572][8954950]|. 
                     Bfd is monomeric and contains a [2Fe-2S] cluster |CITS: 
                     [8639572][8954950]|.
                     Bfd interacts with Bfr |CITS: [8639572]|.
                     Overexpression of Bfd results in a slight increase in the 
                     MIC of penicillin G |CITS: [21173244]|.
                     Bfd: ""<b>b</b>acterioferritin-associated 
                     <b>f</b>erre<b>d</b>oxin"" |CITS: [8954950]|
                     Reviews: |CITS: [9444766][9889981]|"
