                     /product="trifunctional fructoselysine/psicoselysine
                     transporter / psicoselysine transporter / fructoselysine 
                     transporter"
                     /label=frlA
                     /note="FrlA is an uncharacterized member of the APC
                     superfamily of amino acid transporters |CITS: [10931886]|. 
                     Based on the activities of FrlB and FrlD, FrlA is suggested
                     to transport fructoselysine, which can be utilized as a 
                     carbon source |CITS: [12147680]|.
                     A <i>frlA</i> mutant is unable to grow on 20mM 
                     fructoselysine or psicoselysine as the sole source of 
                     carbon |CITS: [14641112]|.
                     FrlA: ""<b>fr</b>uctose<b>l</b>ysine"" |CITS: [12147680]|"
