                     /note="Fructoselysine 3-epimerase catalyzes the
                     interconversion of fructoselysine and psicoselysine |CITS: 
                     [14641112]|.  Fructoselysine 3-epimerase activity is 
                     undetectable when cells are grown on glucose; stationary 
