                     using BoltzNet, a biophysically informed neural network 
                     that infers binding energy from sequence data 
                     |CITS:[40335485]|. The resulting ChIP-seq binding regions 
                     are available in RegulonDB (<a href=""https://regulondb.cc 
                     g.unam.mx/ht/dataset/TFBINDING/source=GALAGAN"">Galagan 
                     collection</a>), and the corresponding energy matrix and 
                     genomic binding profiles can be accessed at <a 
                     href=""http://boltznet.bu.edu"">boltznet.bu.edu</a> 
                     |CITS:[40335485]|."
