     gene            3522707..3523108
                     /gene="hslR"
                     /locus_tag="b3400"
                     /label=hslR
     CDS             3522707..3523108
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="hslR"
                     /locus_tag="b3400"
                     /product="heat shock protein Hsp15"
                     /label=hslR
                     /note="Hsp15 is an abundant, highly conserved heat shock
                     protein with DNA and RNA binding activity |CITS: 
                     [9867837]|.  <i>In vivo</i>, Hsp15 specifically interacts 
                     with the |FRAME: CPLX0-3962| when it contains a nascent 
                     polypeptide chain |CITS: [10675343][19013177]| and is 
                     involved in recycling such complexes |CITS: [19013177]|. 
                     The crystal structure of Hsp15 has been determined at 2 
                     &Aring; resolution, revealing a novel RNA binding motif 
                     that is widely shared among stress proteins, ribosomal 
                     proteins and tRNA synthetases |CITS: [10675344]|.  The 
                     structure of the 50S ribosomal subunit-nascent chain tRNA 
                     complex alone and with Hsp15 has been reconstructed using 
                     cryo-electron microscopy |CITS: [19013177]|.
                     The levels of <i>hslR</i> mRNA and Hsp15 protein are 
                     strongly upregulated after heat shock treatment |CITS: 
                     [8349564][9867837]|.
                     HslR: ""<b>h</b>eat <b>s</b>hock <b>l</b>ocus <b>R</b>"" 
                     |CITS: [8349564]|"
