     gene            3530744..3533065
                     /gene="yhgF"
                     /locus_tag="b3407"
                     /label=yhgF
     CDS             3530744..3533065
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yhgF"
                     /locus_tag="b3407"
                     /product="RNA-binding protein YhgF"
                     /label=yhgF
                     /note="YhgF consists of multiple predicted domains, among
                     them an S1 domain, commonly found in extensively researched
                     RNA-binding proteins (RBPs) |CITS: [36987847]|. In a large 
                     genetic interaction screen, <i>yhgF</i> showed genetic 
                     interactions with a number of proteins involved in 
                     translation and ribosome biogenesis. A &Delta;<i>yhgF</i> 
                     mutant showed increased levels of stop codon readthrough 
                     |CITS: [27732863]|. CLIP-seq showed YhgF to bind 52 
                     different RNAs and the expression of the <i>rmf</i> mRNA 
                     was shown to be affected by the over-expression of YhgF 
                     |CITS: [36987847]|.
                     Evolutive analysis showed that YhgF is present in all 
                     domains of life |CITS: [36987847]|.
                     <i>yhgF</i> insertion mutants were identified in a genetic 
                     screen for genes that are important for survival of 
                     exposure to ionizing radiation (IR). A <i>yhgF</i> deletion
                     mutant had a modest decrease in IR survival |CITS: 
                     [25049088]|."
