                     /product="AsmA family protein YhjG"
                     /label=yhjG
                     /note="Sequence similarity suggests that YhjG may contain 
                     &beta;-barrel structure(s) |CITS: [12192075]|. YhjG is 
                     predicted to be a bitopic inner membrane protein |CITS: 
                     [27510400]|. YhjG, |FRAME: G7875-MONOMER TamB|, |FRAME: 
                     G7690-MONOMER YhdP|, |FRAME: G6703-MONOMER YdbH|, and 
                     |FRAME: EG11684-MONOMER YicH| are |FRAME: EG11361-MONOMER 
                     AsmA|-like paralogs predicted to contain an N-terminal 
                     inner membrane anchor and a large periplasmic region with 
                     chorein-N and AsmA-like domains |CITS: [34781743]|."
