                     /locus_tag="b3548"
                     /product="putative outer membrane protein YhjY"
                     /label=yhjY
                     /note="YhjY is predicted to be an outer membrane protein
                     |CITS: [12761386]|.
                     <i>yhjY</i> is part of a functional interaction network 
                     that includes proteins involved in bacterial adhesion and 
                     biofilm formation.  A <i>yhjY</i> mutant shows increased 
                     biofilm formation |CITS: [25316676]|.
                     A <i>yhjY</i> null mutant was reported to produce less 
                     hydrogen than wild type under fermentation conditions 
                     |CITS: [MOHDYUSOFF12]|.  No attempt to complement the 
                     mutant phenotype with wild-type <i>yhjY</i> is reported."
