                     /product="PF13488 family lipoprotein YiaD"
                     /label=yiaD
                     /note="Sequence similarity suggests that YiaD is a member
                     of the OmpA-OmpF Porin (OOP) Family |CITS: [12192075]|. 
                     YiaD is a verified lipoprotein according to unpublished 
                     data by S. Matsuyama et al. (cited in |CITS: [12876315]|). 
                     <i>yiaD</i> is a multicopy suppressor of a temperature 
                     sensitive <i>bamD</i> mutant |CITS: [21228468]|. Outer 
                     membrane protein profiles of <i>bamD</i> mutants with or 
                     without the <i>yiaD</i> multicopy plasmid suggest that YiaD
                     is involved in the function of BamB |CITS: [21228468]|."
