                     /gene="yiaF"
                     /locus_tag="b3554"
                     /product="DUF3053 domain-containing protein YiaF"
                     /label=yiaF
                     /note="In an assay that involves colonization of a
                     monospecies biofilm with the pathogenic <i>E. coli</i> 
                     strain 55989, a <i>yiaF</i> mutant strain allows a 
                     significantly higher level of colonization by the pathogen 
                     than does the wild type.  A <i>yiaF</i> mutant also shows 
                     altered colonization by pathogens in the mouse gut 
                     environment |CITS: [23667443]|.
                     Epitope-tagged YiaF shows a patchy localization pattern 
                     with a polar and septal bias |CITS: [15130122]|.
                     "
