                     /label=mokA
                     /note="Comment in EcoGene: ""Pseudogene, overlapping
                     regulatory peptide, enables hokB; first 11 aa deleted by 
                     IS150 insertion.  Insertion of IS150 caused a 39 bp 
                     deletion relative to the intact hokA/mokA locus in E. coli 
                     C, removing the starts of mokA and sokA."""
     CDS             complement(3713808..3713992)
