                     /product="small RNA XylZ"
                     /note="The Hfq-dependent small RNA XylZ and 10 potential
                     targets were identified by applying a small RNA prediction 
                     algorithm to RIL-seq data |CITS: [34093460]|.
                     XylZ is most highly expressed during stationary phase 
                     |CITS: [34093460]|.
                     "
     gene            complement(3722803..3724125)
                     /gene="xylA"
                     /locus_tag="b3565"
                     /label=xylA
     CDS             complement(3722803..3724125)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="xylA"
                     /locus_tag="b3565"
                     /product="xylose isomerase"
                     /EC_number="5.3.1.5"
                     /label=xylA
                     /note="Xylose isomerase catalyzes the conversion of
                     D-xylose to D-xylulose, the first reaction in the |FRAME: 
                     XYLCAT-PWY| pathway |CITS: [4908641][6344793][6320721][633 
                     0500][6325179][6327696][TUCKER88]|.
                     Two conserved histidine residues, H101 and H271, were shown
                     to be essential for catalytic activity |CITS: [2405386]|.  
                     The fluorescence of two conserved tryptophan residues, W49 
                     and W188, is quenched during binding of xylose, and W49 was
                     shown to be essential for catalytic activity |CITS: 
                     [1409543]|.  The presence of Mg<sup>2+</sup>, 
                     Mn<sup>2+</sup> or Co<sup>2+</sup> protects the enzyme from
                     thermal denaturation |CITS: [15752361]|.
                     Expression of xylose isomerase is induced in the presence 
                     of xylose |CITS: [4908641][6330500]| and is under 
                     catabolite repression |CITS: [6325179][6327696]|.
                     An amber mutation has been generated |CITS: [12853150]|. 
                     Reviews: |CITS: [8801434][11150612][30238140]|
                     "
