                     phase than during stationary phase in rich media. 
                     Introduction of a stop codon into the <i>baxL</i> ORF leads
                     to increased expression of the downstream <i>baxA</i> gene,
                     suggesting a regulatory role of BaxL |CITS: [30837344]|."
                     /translation="MIKSDQET"
