                     /product="2,3-diketo-L-gulonate reductase"
                     /EC_number="1.1.1.130"
                     /label=yiaK
                     /note="The <i>yiaK</i> gene encodes a
                     2,3-diketo-L-gulonate reductase |CITS: 
                     [11741871][14718529]|.  The enzyme is
                     homodimeric in the crystal structure |CITS: [14718529]|.
                     A YiaK crystal structure is presented at 2.0 &Aring; 
                     resolution, and a structure with NAD and tartrate is 
                     presented at
                     2.2 &Aring; resolution.  The His44 residue is predicted to 
                     be catalytic.  YiaK shows an atypical interaction with NAD 
                     |CITS: [14718529]|.
                     A mutation causing consitutive <i>yiaKLMNO-lyxK-sgbHUE</i> 
                     operon expression results in induction of L-lyxose 
                     metabolic capability |CITS: [9525947]|.
                     Regulation has been described |CITS: [9525947][10913096]|. 
                     "
