     gene            3744278..3744469
                     /pseudo
                     /gene="ysaD"
                     /locus_tag="b4649"
                     /label=ysaD
                     /note="Comment in EcoGene: ""Pseudogene, internal sequence 
                     remnant.  A deletion has apparently removed the N-terminal 
                     regions of ysaC and ysaD. An intact version of this region 
                     is present in O157:H7 with three genes: a putative 
                     AraC-type transcriptional regulator Z5000:Q8XDK9(ysaC), a 
                     putative permease Z5001:Q8XDK7 and a putative glycosidase 
                     Z5002:Q7A9W5(ysaD). Apparently the putative glycosidase was
                     also deleted from K-12. The last C-terminal residues of 
                     YsaD are also missing."""
