                     /locus_tag="b3584"
                     /product="outer membrane protein YiaT"
                     /label=yiaT
                     /note="YiaT is a putative outer membrane protein |CITS: 
                     [12192075]|. YiaT is predicted to contain 10 transmembrane 
                     &beta; strands and 5 outer-exposed loops. C-terminal 
                     truncated YiaT has been used as a membrane anchor for the 
                     surface display of selected proteins |CITS: [25790485]|.
                     A &Delta;<i>yiaT</i> mutant has aggravating genetic 
                     interactions with genes involved in mismatch repair |CITS: 
                     [26774489]|.
                     "
