     CDS             3759697..3760539
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yibA"
                     /locus_tag="b3594"
                     /product="putative lyase containing HEAT-repeat"
                     /label=yibA
                     /note="<i>yibA</i> was identified in a screen for genes
                     that reduce the lethal effects of stress |CITS: 
                     [20128927]|.  Overexpression of <i>yibA</i> increases the 
                     tolerance of <i>E. coli</i> to n-butanol |CITS: 
                     [21408113]|.
                     A <i>yibA</i> insertion mutant is more sensitive than wild 
                     type to mitomycin C and other stresses |CITS: [20128927]|. 
                     A <i>yibA</i> deletion mutant is 2-fold more sensitive to 
                     both X-radiation and UV-radiation than wild type |CITS: 
                     [27718375]|."
