                     /product="protein YibT"
                     /label=yibT
                     /note="<i>yibT</i> was initially predicted as a short open 
                     reading frame (ORF) encoding a 69 residue protein |CITS: 
                     [11445539]| and later detected in the proteome |CITS: 
                     [25063446]|.
                     <i>yibT</i> expression is downregulated in an <i>E. 
                     coli</i> K-12 strain engineered for increased tolerance to 
                     <i>n</i>-butanol |CITS: [27252779]|.  A &Delta;<i>yibT</i> 
                     strain has increased <i>n</i>-butanol tolerance |CITS: 
                     [27252779][33072717]| and an increased proportion of 
                     unsaturated fatty acids (especially palmitoleic and oleic 
                     acid) in total fatty acids compared to wild type |CITS: 
                     [27252779]|."
