     gene            complement(3805251..3805919)
                     /gene="yicR"
                     /locus_tag="b3638"
                     /label=yicR
     CDS             complement(3805251..3805919)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yicR"
                     /locus_tag="b3638"
                     /product="RadC-like JAB domain-containing protein YicR"
                     /label=yicR
                     /note="A &Delta;<i>yicR</i> mutant has aggravating genetic 
                     interactions with genes involved in DNA recombination 
                     |CITS: [26774489]|.
                     The <i>radC102</i> mutation was originally thought to be 
                     allelic with <i>yicR</i>; however, it is shown to be 
                     allelic with <i>recG</i> |CITS: [11053371]|.  <i>yicR</i> 
                     supplied on a low-copy-number vector did not alter UV 
                     sensitivities of <i>recG</i> mutants or their background 
                     strain |CITS: [11053371]|.  In a previous experiment, the 
                     cloned <i>yicR</i> gene partially complemented the 
                     <i>radC102</i> allele for UV resistance, but made the 
                     wild-type strain more sensitive |CITS: [1374847]|.
                     The YicR open reading frame encodes interacting sequence 
                     tags, suggesting that the protein may assemble into 
                     multisubunit complexes |CITS: [14973045]|.
                     <i>yicR</i> is the first gene in an operon with 
                     <i>rpmB</i>, <i>rpmG</i>, and <i>fpg</i> |CITS: 
                     [10400579]|.  The <i>yicR</i> gene is thought to be a 
                     member of the CreBC regulon; expression is induced during 
                     growth in miminal medium with glucose |CITS: [11350954]|. 
                     4,5-dihydroxy-2-cyclopenten-1-one altered the expression of
                     several CreBC-regulated genes, but not <i>radC</i> |CITS: 
                     [12426362]|."
                     /translation="MKNNSQLLMPREKMLKFGISALTDVELLALFLRTGTRGKDVLTLA
                     KEMLENFGSLYGLLTSEYEQFSGVHGIGVAKFAQLKGIAELARRYYNVRMREESPLLSP
