                     /label=yicJ
                     /note="<i>yicJI</i> is predicted to be a member of the
                     |FRAME: EG20253-MONOMER ""XylR""| regulon; its products may
                     mediate transport (YicJ) and hydrolysis (YicI) of 
                     xylooligosaccharides; putative XylR and CRP binding sites 
                     are identified upstream of <i>yicJI</i> |CITS: [11750821]| 
                     YicJ is a member of the GPH family of 
                     glycoside-pentoside-hexuronide transporters |CITS: 
                     [8830272][26546518]|."
