     CDS             3853643..3854536
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yidL"
                     /locus_tag="b3680"
                     /product="putative DNA-binding transcriptional regulator
                     YidL"
                     /label=yidL
                     /note="YidL was predicted to be an AraC-type transcription 
                     factor |CITS: [34428301] [35880217]| and it was predicted 
                     that this protein regulates genes related to metabolism and
                     transport |CITS: [35880217]|.
                     Genome-wide YidL binding sites were determined <i>in 
                     vivo</i> by the chromatin immunoprecipitation method 
                     combined with lambda exonuclease digestion (ChIP-exo) in 
                     glucose M9 minimal medium |CITS: [34428301]|.
                     Expression of <i>yidL</i> is positively regulated by 
                     BglJ-RcsB and negatively regulated by HNS |CITS: 
                     [24335284]|. This gene is affected by conditions that lead 
                     to biofilm formation |CITS: [35880217]|.
                     Insertion mutants showed reduced growth in M9 glucose 
                     minimal medium compared to growth in rich medium |CITS: 
                     [16820464]|.
                     Mutations in <i>yidL</i> were identified in 
                     copper-resistant strains evolved experimentally |CITS:[ 
                     35740118]|.
                     "
