                     /product="putative PTS enzyme II component GlvB"
                     /label=glvB
                     /note="The deduced amino acid sequence of GlvB shows
                     similarity with the IIB domain of various Enzyme II 
                     proteins (including |FRAME: NAGE-MONOMER ""NagE""| - Enzyme
                     II of the N-acetylglucosamine PTS - and |FRAME: 
                     PTSG-MONOMER ""PtsG""| - Enzyme IIBC of the glucose PTS) 
                     and contains a conserved cysteine residue (Cys92); the 
                     <i>glv</i> operon (<i>glvCBG</i>) may be cryptic in wild 
                     type <i>E. coli</i> K-12 |CITS:[8019415]|.
                     <i>glvB</i> is a pseudogene candidate in <i>E. coli</i> 
                     K-12 |CITS: [12234664]|.
                     "
