                     /product="putative PTS enzyme II component GlvC"
                     /label=glvC
                     /note="The deduced amino acid sequence of GlvC displays 
                     similarity with |FRAME: MALX-MONOMER ""MalX""| and with the
                     IIC domains of |FRAME: NAGE-MONOMER ""NagE""| (Enzyme II of
                     the N-acetylglucosamine PTS) and |FRAME: PTSG-MONOMER 
                     ""PtsG""| (Enzyme IIBC of the glucose PTS); the <i>glv</i> 
                     operon (<i>glvCBG</i>) may be cryptic in wild type <i>E. 
                     coli</i> K-12 |CITS:[8019415]|.
                     Expression of <i>glvC</i> is decreased in a <i>luxS</i> 
                     deletion mutant during growth in LB (no glucose) 
                     |CITS:[16321939]|.
                     <i>glvC</i> and <i>glvB</i> are pseudogene candidates in 
                     <i>E. coli</i> K-12. The genome of <i>E. coli</i> O157 
                     contains a complete <i>glvC</i> homolog |CITS: 
                     [12234664]|."
