                     catabolism protein YidR"
                     /label=yidR
                     /note="The similarity of the metabolon signature of the
                     Keio collection <i>yidR</i> deletion mutant to that of 
                     mutants in genes with known function suggest a role for 
                     YidR in gluconate/galacturonate metabolism.  In support of 
                     this hypothesis, the <i>yidR</i> mutant shows a growth 
                     defect when grown on galactonate or galacturonate as the 
                     sole source of carbon |CITS: [28093455]|."
