                     /product="colicin M resistance protein"
                     /label=cbrA
                     /note="Overproduction of CbrA confers resistance to
                     colicin M |CITS: [22773789]|.
                     Transcription of <i>cbrA</i> is induced by the CreBC 
                     two-component system by minimal media growth conditions 
                     |CITS: [11350954]|, and in a <i>luxS</i> mutant |CITS: 
                     [11514505]|.
