                     <i>cbrA</i> mutant shows higher resistance to hydroxylamine
                     and hypersensitivity to ofloxacin, a lipophilic chelator, 
                     and an ionophore |CITS: [12897016]|. CbrA: 
                     ""<i><b>c</b>re<b>B</b></i>-<b>r</b>egulated <b>A</b>"" 
