     CDS             complement(3915420..3915800)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="atpI"
                     /locus_tag="b3739"
                     /product="ATP synthase accessory factor AtpI"
                     /label=atpI
                     /note="A nonpolar mutation in the <i>atpI</i> gene shows
                     that the AtpI protein is not an essential component of the 
                     H<sup>+</sup>-ATPase complex.  However, the mutant has a 
                     slightly lower growth yield, and membranes contain 20% less
                     ATPase activity than wild-type |CITS: [6327640]|. 
                     Expression of AtpI is 10 to 20-fold lower than expression 
                     of AtpB, which is encoded by the second open reading frame 
                     of the <i>atp</i> operon |CITS: [2524469]|.  Processing of 
                     the mRNA and low efficiency of translation initiation may 
                     account for lower levels of <i>atpI</i> transcript and AtpI
                     protein |CITS: [2472380][1834655][1373327][8679701]|. 
                     <i>atpI</i> appears to affect AtpB expression at a 
                     post-translation initiation step |CITS: [7672111]|. 
                     <i>unc</i>: <U>unc</U>oupled mutants (see |CITS: 
                     [157712]|).
                     Review: |CITS: [2894371]|"
