                     /product="uncharacterized protein IlvX"
                     /label=ilvX
                     /note="The IlvX open reading frame was predicted based on
                     the presence of a ribosome binding site in an intergenic 
                     region, and expression of the small protein was detected 
                     during stationary phase |CITS: [19121005]|.  As expected, 
                     levels of IlvX are higher during growth in minimal medium 
                     compared to rich medium |CITS: [19734316]|."
