     CDS             4010693..4012120
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="rmuC"
                     /locus_tag="b3832"
                     /product="putative recombination limiting protein RmuC"
                     /label=rmuC
                     /note="RmuC contains a PD-(D/E)XK nuclease domain that is
                     most similar to that of the McrC nuclease |CITS: 
                     [16011798]|.
                     An <i>rmuC</i> mutant generates increased DNA inversions at
                     mini-Tn<i>10</i> sites in an <i>rmuA</i> mutant background 
                     |CITS: [10886369]|.  An <i>rmuC</i> deletion mutant is more
                     sensitive to kasugamycin than wild type |CITS: [23308060]|.
                     Transcription is induced by nalidixic acid or mitomycin C, 
                     and induction requires LexA |CITS: [11544210]|.
                     RmuC is predicted to be a bitopic inner membrane protein 
                     |CITS: [27510400]|.
                     RmuC: ""<b>r</b>earrangement <b>mu</b>tator <b>C</b>"" 
                     |CITS: [10886369]|"
