                     /gene="yihO"
                     /locus_tag="b3876"
                     /product="bifunctional putative sulfoquinovose transporter
                     / sulfoquinovose transporter"
                     /label=yihO
                     /note="An <i>E. coli</i> K-12 <i>&Delta;yihO</i> strain
                     does not grow when sulfoquinovose is supplied as the sole 
                     carbon source. <i>yihO</i> is part of a 10-gene cluster 
                     which is conserved across <i>E. coli</i> species and has 
                     been implicated in sulfoquinovose catabolism |CITS: 
                     [24463506]|. The YihO protein is a member of the 
                     glycoside-pentoside-hexuronide (GPH) cation symporter 
                     family of transporters |CITS: [8830272]| but its transport 
                     mechanism has not been experimentally characterised."
