     gene            complement(4062835..4063761)
                     /gene="yihR"
                     /locus_tag="b3879"
                     /label=yihR
     CDS             complement(4062835..4063761)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yihR"
                     /locus_tag="b3879"
                     /product="putative sulfoquinovose mutarotase YihR"
                     /label=yihR
                     /note="YihR may be a sulfoquinovose mutarotase.  The gene 
                     cluster encoding enzymes of the sulfoquinovose degradation 
                     pathway is conserved.  The YihR homolog of 
                     <i>Herbaspirillum seropedicaea</i> was shown to have 
                     sulfoquinovose mutarotase activity |CITS: [29535276]|. 
                     Note, however, that the best BLAST hit of the <i>H. 
                     seropedicaea</i> protein in the <i>E. coli</i> genome is 
                     |FRAME: G7338-MONOMER YphB| rather than YihR.
                     YihR appears to be involved in biofilm formation.  A mutant
                     with a deletion of <i>yihR</i> shows a significant decrease
                     in biofilm formation |CITS: [16385049]|. Expression of 
                     <i>yihR</i> increases 11-fold upon deletion of <i>tqsA</i> 
                     (which increases biofilm formation) |CITS: [16385049]|, and
                     is induced by growth on sulfoquinovose |CITS: [24463506]|."
