     gene            4073111..4073329
                     /gene="yiiF"
                     /locus_tag="b3890"
                     /label=yiiF
     CDS             4073111..4073329
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yiiF"
                     /locus_tag="b3890"
                     /product="protein YiiF"
                     /label=yiiF
                     /note="YiiF appears to belong to the AraC family of 
                     transcription factors, and it was predicted to regulate 
                     genes related to metabolism |CITS: [35880217]|. Upstream of
                     the <i>yiiF</i> gene, a sequence was found that could work 
                     as a transcriptional promoter, and the transcription of the
                     <i>yiiF</i> gene is affected by glucose-lactose shift and 
                     conditions that generate general transcriptional 
                     termination |CITS: [35880217]|.
                     A transposon insertion in the intergenic region between 
                     <i>yiiE</i> and <i>yiiF</i>, which potentially affects 
                     expression of <i>yiiF</i>, confers increased resistance to 
                     thymol |CITS: [17949301]|."
