                     /label=fdoI
                     /note="<i>fdoI</i> encodes the &gamma; subunit of formate 
                     dehydrogenase O. It has 45% amino acid identity (over an 
                     alignment of 156 residues) with the heme <i>b</i> binding, 
                     &gamma; subunit (FdnI) of formate dehydrogenase-N |CITS: 
                     [8346018]|.
                     Both the N- and C-terminus of FdoI appear to be located in 
                     the cytoplasm and it is predicted to have 4 transmembrane 
                     regions |CITS: [9852007]|."
