                     /product="cystine exporter"
                     /label=yijE
                     /note="YijE belongs to the drug/metabolite exporter (DME)
                     family of inner membrane proteins |CITS: [11432728]|. The 
                     protein has ten predicted transmembrane domains; its C 
                     terminus is located in the cytoplasm |CITS: [15919996]|. 
                     The expression of <i>yijE</i> is upregulated in the 
                     presence of 10&micro;M cystine; overexpression of 
                     <i>yijE</i> from a plasmid confers resistance to the growth
                     inhibitory effects of 80&micro;M cystine; deletion of 
                     <i>yijE</i> results in increased sensitivity to 20&micro;M 
                     cystine |CITS: [25346166]|."
