     rRNA            4198075..4199616
                     /gene="rrsE"
                     /locus_tag="b4007"
                     /product="16S ribosomal RNA"
                     /label=rrsE
                     /note="The 16S rRNA is the RNA component of the small
                     subunit (30S subunit) of the <i>E. coli</i> ribosome. There
                     are seven ribosomal RNA (rRNA) operons, called |FRAME: 
                     EG30084|, |FRAME: EG30085|, |FRAME: EG30086|, |FRAME: 
                     EG30087|, |FRAME: EG30088|, |FRAME: EG30089|, and |FRAME: 
                     EG30090| |CITS: [COLISALII]|.  Each operon contains a 16S 
                     rRNA gene, a 23S rRNA gene, and a 5S rRNA gene (except the 
                     rrsD operon, which contains two 5S rRNA genes) interspersed
                     with various tRNA genes |CITS: [COLISALII]|.  Regarding 
                     nomenclature, ""<i>rrs</i>"" genes encode 16S rRNAs, 
                     ""<i>rrl</i>"" genes encode 23S rRNAs, and ""<i>rrf</i>"" 
                     genes encode 5S rRNAs |CITS: [COLISALII]|. <i>rrsE</i> has 
                     the highest promoter activity of all rRNA operons on 
                     different culture media |CITS:[ 26717514]|. <i>rrsE</i> has
                     the lowest promoter activity of all rRNA operons in mutants
                     lacking Fis |CITS:[ 26717514]|.
                     The sequence and structure of the 16S rRNA has been 
                     described |CITS: [5340599], [4868442], [4299552], 
                     [4311070], [4903099], [4910391], [4927343], [4916974], 
                     [4932242], [4941835], [4935734], [4935735], [4935736], 
                     [4569972], [4569973], [4551094], [4562230], [4354606], 
                     [4356617], [4597768], [4620018], [4371816], [4374383], 
                     [4616170], [1106773], [1091918], [1089909], [167351], 
                     [1099457], [1103089], [809718], [780350], [818623], 
                     [787927], [786726], [322143], [379604], [347396], [351619],
                     [358146], [368799], [362531], [477513], [387717], [388420],
                     [392471], [93692], [6153384], [6159576], [6160459], 
                     [6160460], [6996708], [6784944], [6162161], [6163215], 
                     [6170942], [6170632], [7024918], [7029465], [7030394], 
                     [6285311], [6750555], [6188539], [6340066], [6194995], 
                     [6359058], [6363901], [6401121], [6200766], [6207855], 
                     [3882675], [3923479], [3907698], [3935157], [2997731], 
                     [2418415], [3720727], [3299045], [3126826], [3323531], 
                     [2853815], [2451022], [2482760], [2453025], [2457499], 
                     [2837729], [3048381], [3048388], [2457514], [2468977], 
                     [2464291], [2464693], [2642480], [2686708], [2654936], 
                     [2476177], [2675971], [2477554], [2689654], [2179567], 
                     [2408047], [2207172], [2171681], [2236056], [2001727], 
                     [1712940], [1712293], [1872848], [1960712], [1896466], 
                     [1547215], [1374556], [1280994], [1280995], [7681419], 
                     [7691600], [8241431], [7518524], [8643402], [8643405], 
                     [7543481], [7567470], [8721993], [7479839], [8658142], 
                     [8910275], [9122161], [9174095], [9222495], [9171076], 
                     [9271564], [9281424], [9310353], [9354641], [9421514], 
                     [9677294], [9784367], [9799506], [9814765], [9835591], 
                     [9893990], [10347223], [10411129], [10536142], [10747796], 
                     [10793686], [10864503], [11000271], [11090278], [11214183],
                     [11243814], [11327780], [11502181], [11552678], [11812846],
                     [11860288], [11947429], [12126618], [12126619], [12788352],
                     [12836305], [12859155]|. The long leader-trailer helices on
                     both pre-16S rRNA and pre-23S rRNA transcripts are 
                     important for biogenesis of these RNAs and understanding 
                     the leader and trailer base-pairing; these structures are 
                     found in all phyla of bacteria and archaea |CITS: 
                     [39043438]|.
                     The relationship of the 16S rRNA to ribosome assembly, 
                     structure, and function has been characterized |CITS: 
                     [4551094], [4589452], [4594437], [4592471], [4597072], 
                     [4610566], [4371816], [1090843], [1092437], [803646], 
                     [765770], [1219394], [167351], [1098691], [766751], 
                     [1104582], [1107998], [765762], [764867], [768982], 
                     [823528], [778638], [782519], [786726], [794830], [323854],
                     [400797], [327330], [329865], [341969], [354688], [360077],
                     [370785], [375223], [107964], [387717], [388420], [114214],
                     [385051], [398003], [6996748], [7019858], [6986611], 
                     [6998892], [6996708], [7003539], [6163479], [7029211], 
                     [7011367], [6165012], [7013827], [6170320], [7029538], 
                     [7030394], [6274438], [6173062], [6750359], [6813860], 
                     [6340734], [6349628], [6348775], [6354253], [6385981], 
                     [6197085], [6422982], [6422983], [6366737], [6396503], 
                     [2578388], [2582234], [3907695], [3907696], [3900929], 
                     [3510432], [3003738], [3513310], [3521723], [2425339], 
                     [2430725], [3126826], [2451022], [3277159], [2839766], 
                     [3283702], [2457498], [2457499], [3139078], [3288986], 
                     [2455279], [2459390], [3048388], [2461734], [3186700], 
