     CDS             4203162..4203545
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yjaA"
                     /locus_tag="b4011"
                     /product="stress response protein"
                     /label=yjaA
                     /note="YjaA is involved in the cellular response to
                     hydrogen peroxide and acid stress |CITS: [19919618]|.
                     A <i>yjaA</i> mutant is more sensitive to hydrogen peroxide
                     and acid stress than wild type and shows increased biofilm 
                     formation |CITS: [19919618]|.
                     The <i>yjaA</i> gene has been used as a marker for 
                     phylogenetic analysis |CITS: 
                     [11010916][17021100][18518895]|."
                     /translation="MSVLYIQIRRNQITVRDLESKREVSGDAAFSNQRLLIANFFVAEK
