                     /note="In a large genetic interaction screen, <i>yjbM</i>
                     was enriched for negative differential genetic interaction 
                     scores with cell envelope-related localization genes when 
                     comparing growth in rich medium versus growth at low 
                     temperature.  Cells of a &Delta;<i>yjbM</i> mutant are 
                     longer than wild type cells when grown at 16&deg;C |CITS: 
                     [27732863]|.
                     "
                     /translation="MWVNKYIDDCTDEDLNDRDFIASVVDRAIFHFAINSICNPGDNKD
                     AMPIEQCTFDVETKNDLPSTVQLFYEESKDNEPLANIHFQAIGSGFLTFVNACQEHDDN
                     SLKLFASLLISLSYSSAYADLSETVYINENNESYLKAQFEKLSQRDMKKYLGEMKRLAD
