                     /product="PF04237 family protein YjbR"
                     /label=yjbR
                     /note="A solution structure of YjbR has been determined,
                     and structural similarity to the ""double wing"" DNA 
                     binding motif was found |CITS: [17266124]|.
                     Expression of <i>yjbR</i> is upregulated in a strain 
                     containing the <i>ompR234</i> allele (an <i>ompR</i> 
                     up-mutation) |CITS: [14523117]|.
                     "
                     /translation="MTISELLQYCMAKPGAEQSVHNDWKATQIKVEDVLFAMVKEVENR
