     misc_RNA        complement(4267854..4267994)
                     /gene="ryjA"
                     /locus_tag="b4459"
                     /product="small RNA RyjA"
                     /note="SraL is a small RNA of approximately 140 nt in
                     length |CITS: [11445539][11448770]|.
                     SraL does not interact with Hfq |CITS: [11445539]| and 
                     appears to be polyadenylated |CITS: [11448770]|. RyjA 
                     interacts with the protein |FRAME: EG12866-MONOMER| |CITS: 
                     [36328526]|.
                     SraL is expressed in stationary phase cells |CITS: 
                     [11445539][11448770]|.
                     Sra: ""small RNA"" |CITS: [11448770]|<br>PsrA: ""predicted 
