     gene            4319177..4320055
                     /gene="rdcB"
                     /locus_tag="b4110"
                     /label=rdcB
     CDS             4319177..4320055
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="rdcB"
                     /locus_tag="b4110"
                     /product="regulator of diguanylate cyclase RdcB"
                     /label=rdcB
                     /note="Together with RdcA, RdcB controls the activity of
                     the DgcE diguanylate cyclase |CITS: [31022167]|.
                     RdcB physically interacts with RdcA, which is able to 
                     interact with DgcE and regulate its activity |CITS: 
                     [31022167]|.
                     The mRNA of <i>rdcB</i> appears to interact with the small 
                     regulatory RNA GlnZ, but it is not known how it regulates 
                     such mRNA |CITS: [36062564]|.
                     A mutation in <i>rdcB</i> partially suppresses the motility
                     defect of a &Delta;<i>pdeH</i> mutant |CITS: [17941710]|.  
                     A &Delta;<i>rdcB</i> mutant shows a defect in biofilm 
                     formation |CITS: [31022167]|.
                     RdcB: ""<b>r</b>egulator of a <b>d</b>iguanylate 
                     <b>c</b>yclase <b>B</b>"" |CITS: [31022167]|"
