     CDS             4358481..4358957
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="fxsA"
                     /locus_tag="b4140"
                     /product="protein FxsA"
                     /label=fxsA
                     /note="FxsA overproduction inhibits F exclusion of
                     bacteriophage T7 |CITS: [10497016], [10497017]|.
                     FxsA localizes to the inner membrane |CITS: [10497017]|.
                     A gain-of-function mutation in the fxsA promoter that 
                     causes fxsA overexpression results in resistance to 
                     coexpression of gene 10 from bacteriophage T7 with the pifA
                     gene from the F plasmid |CITS: [10497016]|. This 
                     gain-of-function mutation also results in resistance to 
                     coexpression of gene 1.2 from bacteriophage T7 with the 
                     pifA gene from the F plasmid |CITS: [10497016]|.  An fxsA 
                     null mutant is viable |CITS: [10497016]|.
                     Fxs: ""F exclusion of bacteriophage T7"" |CITS: 
                     [10497016]|.
                     Regulation has been described |CITS: [10497016]|."
