                     /product="bifunctional fumarate reductase [Fe-S] protein /
                     fumarate reductase"
                     /EC_number="1.3.5.1"
                     /label=frdB
                     /note="This is one of two catalytic subunits of the four
                     subunit fumarate reductase complex. FrdB contains 11 
                     cysteine residues arranged in three clusters predicted to 
                     form the iron-sulfur clusters |CITS: [6751816]|. This 
                     subunit contains three iron-sulfur clusters: a 4Fe-4S, a 
                     3Fe-4S and a 2Fe-2S |CITS: [10373108]|.
                     This subunit has 38% identity to the succinate 
                     dehydrogenase iron-sulfur binding subunit, SdhB |CITS: 
                     [6388571]|."
