                     /product="epoxyqueuosine reductase"
                     /EC_number="1.17.99.6"
                     /label=queG
                     /note="Epoxyqueuosine reductase catalyzes the final step
                     in the <i>de novo</i> synthesis of queuosine, the anticodon
                     loop modification found in tRNA(Asp), tRNA(Asn), tRNA(His),
                     and tRNA(Tyr) |CITS: [21502530]|.
                     The enzyme was identified by screening the Keio collection 
                     of single-gene knockouts for the presence of epoxyqueuosine
                     (oQ) and lack of queuosine (Q) in tRNAs by tandem 
                     UV-visible spectrophotometry and mass spectroscopy |CITS: 
                     [21502530]|."
