                     /note="Deletion of <i>yjfMC</i> exacerbates the growth
                     defects observed when <i>E. coli tolC</i> mutants are grown
                     in glucose minimal media |CITS: [20545840]|."
                     /translation="MARKRKSRNNSKIGHGAISRIGRPNNPFEPCRNRYAQKYLTLALM
                     GGAAFFVLKGCSDSSDVDNDGDGTFYATVQDCIDDGNNADICARGWNNAKTAFYADVPK
                     NMTQQNCQSKYENCYYDNVEQSWIPVVSGFLLSRVIRKDRDEPFVYNSGGSSFASRPVW
