                     /label=bsmA
                     /note="<i>bsmA</i> is upregulated during biofilm growth on 
                     serine limited defined medium; a <i>bsmA</i> insertion 
                     mutant exhibits reduced microcolony formation in flow cells
                     and greater flagellar motility on soft agar; biofilms from 
                     the mutant strain are less able to resist acid and peroxide
                     stress |CITS: [19833773]|.
