                     /label=ytfF
                     /note="YtfF is an inner membrane protein with 10 predicted 
                     transmembrane helices.  The C terminus of the protein is 
                     located
                     on the cytoplasmic side of the membrane |CITS: [15919996]|.
                     In the Transporter Classification Database YtfF is a member
                     of the Drug/Metabolite Transporter (DMT) superfamily |CITS:
                     [24225317]|."
