     CDS             complement(4447131..4447682)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="yjgA"
                     /locus_tag="b4234"
                     /product="putative ribosome biogenesis factor YjgA"
                     /label=yjgA
                     /note="YjgA interacts with nucleotides in a number of
                     specific positions within 23S rRNA, connecting the central 
                     protuberance with the L1 stalk and moving it from its 
                     neutral position by ~20 &Aring;.  YjgA may thus have a 
                     quality control function |CITS: [33639093]|.
                     YjgA was found to associate with the 50S subunit of the 
                     ribosome |CITS: [16980477][23228329]|.  Cryo-EM 
                     reconstructions of 50S ribosomal subunit precursors 
                     revealed a network of interacting ribosomal biogenesis 
                     factors that consists of YjgA, RluD, RsfS, and ObgE |CITS: 
                     [33639093]|.
                     "
