                     transport of ferric dicitrate"
                     /EC_number="7.2.2.18"
                     /label=fecC
                     /note="FecC is one of two (along with FecD) integral
                     membrane proteins of the iron dicitrate ABC transport 
                     system.
                     <i>fecC</i> encodes a hydrophobic inner membrane protein; 
                     FecC has 34% identity with FecD and also shows similarity 
                     to FhuB of the iron(III) hydroxamate uptake system and BtuC
                     of the Vitamin B uptake system |CITS: [2651410]|
