                     /note="YjhF is a member of the gluconate:H<sup>+</sup>
                     symporter (GntP) family of transporters |CITS: 
                     [9119199][26546518]|.  Cloned <i>yjhF</i> does not confer 
                     gluconate transport activity when expressed in a gluconate 
                     transport deficient <i>E. coli</i> strain |CITS: 
