     gene            4517794..4517883
                     /gene="ryjB"
                     /locus_tag="b4624"
                     /label=ryjB
     misc_RNA        4517794..4517883
                     /gene="ryjB"
                     /locus_tag="b4624"
                     /product="small RNA RyjB"
                     /note="RyjB was detected in a cloning-based screen for
                     small RNAs |CITS: [15718303]|.  RyjB appears to contribute 
                     to the stabilization of <i>rnb</i> mRNA |CITS: [31744883]|.
                      Overexpression of RyjB appears to lead to increased 
                     abundance of the <i>sgcA</i> mRNA |CITS: [34967409]|.
                     RyjB interacts with the protein |FRAME: EG12866-MONOMER| 
                     |CITS: [36328526]|.
                     RyjB is expressed under all tested growth conditions |CITS:
                     [15718303][14622403]|, but is more abundant during 
                     exponential growth |CITS: [34967409]|.  RyjB was initially 
                     shown to be less abundant in an <i>hfq</i> mutant |CITS: 
                     [14622403]|; later experiments show little difference in 
                     RyjB abundance in an <i>hfq</i> mutant compared to wild 
                     type during exponential growth |CITS: [34967409]|. 
                     Expression of <i>ryjB</i> is increased at higher 
                     concentrations of Mg<sup>2+</sup> |CITS: [21665928]| and is
                     induced by acid stress |CITS: [34967409]|.  Acid stress 
                     induction of <i>ryjB</i> expression appears to depend on 
                     PhoP |CITS: [34967409]|.
                     Review: |CITS: [32213244]|"
