                     /product="D-mannonate dehydratase"
                     /EC_number="4.2.1.8"
                     /label=uxuA
                     /note="D-mannonate dehydratase catalyzes the final
                     reaction of the glucuronate branch of the hexuronate 
                     degradation pathway |CITS: [6997263]|.
                     UxuA is monomeric in solution.  Crystal structures of the 
                     enzyme alone and in complex with D-mannonate have been 
                     solved |CITS: [22796868]|.
                     The enzyme is inducible by glucuronate and fructuronate 
                     |CITS: [4581499]|.  Expression of <i>uxuA</i> may be 
                     repressed by OxyR |CITS: [11443091]|.
                     UxuA: ""<b>u</b>tilization of he<b>xu</b>ronate <b>A</b>"""
