                     /locus_tag="b4722"
                     /product="iraD leader peptide"
                     /label=idlP
                     /note="The <i>iraD</i> leader peptide is encoded upstream
                     of |FRAME: G7923-MONOMER|; its translation is negatively 
                     regulated by the |FRAME: EG11447-MONOMER| CsrA.  The stop 
                     codon of the leader peptide overlaps the IraD start codon, 
                     and IraD translation is coupled to that of the leader 
                     peptide.  CsrA thus also negatively regulates IraD 
                     translation |CITS: [28851853]|.
                     IdlP: ""<i><b>i</b>ra<b>D</b></i> <b>l</b>eader 
                     <b>p</b>eptide"""
                     /translation="MENEHQYSGARCSGQAAYVAKRQECAK"
