     CDS             complement(4567775..4568671)
                     /codon_start=1
                     /gene="mcrB"
                     /locus_tag="b4346"
                     /product="mcrB-S"
                     /label=mcrB
                     /note="The McrB<sub>S</sub> gene product of <i>mcrB</i> is 
                     generated by alternative translation initiation, resulting 
                     in a shorter peptide that lacks the 161 N-terminal amino 
                     acids of McrB that are required for DNA binding |CITS: 
                     [2649480][2203735][1312983][1316864]|.
                     McrB<sub>S</sub> may be required for stabilization of the 
                     McrBC restriction complex |CITS: [9401036]| or as an 
                     inhibitor of DNA cleavage due to sequestration of McrC 
                     |CITS: [9736625]|."
