                     /gene="lgoD"
                     /locus_tag="b4358"
                     /product="L-galactonate oxidoreductase"
                     /EC_number="1.1.1.414"
                     /label=lgoD
                     /note="LgoD is an L-galactonate oxidoreductase |CITS: 
                     [24861318]| that is required for growth on L-galactonate as
                     the sole carbon source under high-throughput growth 
                     conditions with limited aeration |CITS: [17088549]|.  LgoD 
                     did not show dehydrogenase activity in a high-throughput 
                     screen of purified proteins; however, L-galactonate was not
                     tested as a substrate |CITS: [15808744]|.  LgoD may be the 
                     L-galactonate oxidoreductase involved in the degradation of
                     L-galactonate that was described in |CITS: [381020]|.
                     Expression of <i>lgoD</i> is increased during growth on 
                     L-galactonate compared to growth on L-lactate |CITS: 
                     [17088549]|.  UxuR appears to regulate <i>lgoD</i> 
                     expression |CITS: [21622752]|.
                     "
